translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4311627e:

    # "Surprise!"
    "惊喜！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_814ee3ad:

    # "Many familiar faces jump out at you."
    "许多熟悉的面孔突然出现在你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4e9242c6:

    # "Basically everyone you have met in Lusterfield is here."
    "在乐斯民菲尔德见过的每一个人 基本上都在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4e7dd2f6:

    # "Food lines the tables, and drinks are flowing freely."
    "食物铺满桌面，饮品随意供应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_080d1134:

    # "You don't know what is happening. But at least everyone is in a jovial mood."
    "你不知道发生了什么。但至少大家的心情都很愉快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4b7b6018:

    # o "[e]! Welcome! We figured it'd be a surprise for you."
    o "[e]！欢迎！我们就猜到这会给你一个惊喜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a2dce147:

    # "You see Ole nudge his elbow into Haskell's side."
    "你看到奥利把他的肘 伸进哈斯凯尔的身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e36cdc95:

    # h "mhmm...! You almost made me choke-... uh... Good to see you here, [e]."
    h "嗯嗯……！你差点让我噎住——呃……很高兴在这里见到你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_00ed9177:

    # e "Haskell, you're here too?"
    e "哈斯凯尔，你也在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bfd87bf4:

    # "You see Haskell continue to sip his tea."
    "你看到哈斯凯尔继续啜饮着他的茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f3efc263:

    # a "[e]! The Tavern is getting so crowded! Everyone's here."
    a "[e]！酒馆里越来越挤了！大家都来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3adc113e:

    # l "Well, he's my disciple after all. [e], I'll let you get the spotlight just this once."
    l "毕竟他是我的弟子。[e]，这次就让你成为焦点吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_fed08a01:

    # e "T-thank you, Lothar, I'm glad you're here."
    e "谢谢你,洛萨尔,很高兴你来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_27407141:

    # "You notice Rahim standing to the side, waving at you."
    "你注意到雷希姆站在一边 向你挥手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1dbba092:

    # e "Rahim?"
    e "雷希姆?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_934fbf66:

    # r "...Just here to see how the tavern is doing. But, the party is well deserved."
    r "……只是来看看酒馆经营得怎么样。不过，这场派对确实值得举办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5151fce8:

    # "Seb hops over."
    "塞布蹦跳着过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_fdbde2ee:

    # s "Roomie! You're finally here!"
    s "室友！你终于来了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_867ee791:

    # e "Seb, wh-what's all this?"
    e "塞布，怎、怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a5bc4df7:

    # s "It's a party! Duh!"
    s "是派对！这还用问吗！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_cb4792de:

    # e "Party? What's the occasion?"
    e "派对？是为了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f7c4ca19:

    # s "It's to celebrate you being a part of Lusterfield!"
    s "庆祝你加入乐斯民菲尔德!"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a9bebdf4:

    # e "Th-that's..."
    e "这、这是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_95efb19d:

    # "You are gobsmacked. You have never had a party thrown in your honor before. You feel touched."
    "你目瞪口呆。你以前从没享受过以自己为主角的派对，心里不由得一阵感动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f16e69cb:

    # "Then, you frown."
    "然后，你皱起了眉头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_26ea3589:

    # e "Wait. So there's no training after all?"
    e "等等，所以其实不用训练了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e2af3c26:

    # s "Yea. That was just a distraction to send you away so that we could get things prepared. I was shocked that you fell for it, Roomie!"
    s "没错。那只是把你支开、给我们准备派对的障眼法。我真没想到你居然会上当，室友！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4bcfcc91:

    # "Seb guffaws as he smacks your back."
    "塞布拍着你的后背，哈哈大笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_656b3ecc:

    # s "Anyway, Roomie, I won't hog anymore of your time. You should go to talk to everyone! This is your party after all."
    s "总之，室友，我就不再占用你的时间了。你应该去和大家聊聊！这可是你的派对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5281b9b5:

    # s "But before we go, remember to come back and talk to your Roomie, that's me!"
    s "不过在我们走之前，记得回来和你的室友，也就是我，聊聊天！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1036c5d1:

    # "You look around the tavern, and the people you have come to know as friends and mentors nod and smile at you."
    "你环顾酒馆，那些已经成为你朋友和导师的人纷纷朝你点头微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a126a96b:

    # "Everyone is enjoying the festivities... Some more than others."
    "大家都在享受这场庆典……只是有人比其他人更尽兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ab0cf4cf:

    # "The tavern has been cleaned in preparation, and the normal patrons are nowhere to be seen."
    "酒馆已经提前打扫干净，平时的客人也一个都看不见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_c7cf4238:

    # "You believe this celebration is invite-only."
    "你觉得这场庆祝活动只邀请了特定的人参加。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f4d9d7db:

    # "You see Cane working the counter as usual. He is pouring out the drinks."
    "你看到凯恩像往常一样在柜台工作 他在倒酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ebc05101:

    # "You walk over to talk to the barkeep."
    "你走过去和酒保交谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5ecd6061:

    # c "Today is a special day so I'm not going to get ya to work."
    c "今天是个特别的日子，所以我不打算叫你干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_9bb94d53:

    # c "So go mingle around. There's no reason to stick around here with an old bat."
    c "去和大家聊聊吧。没必要和我这个老家伙待在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_552bc535:

    # e "Cane, thank you."
    e "凯恩,谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_62216291:

    # c "Whatcha thanking me for?"
    c "你谢我干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b154739d:

    # e "Well, this is your tavern, right? The food and the drinks must be expensive too."
    e "可是，这是你的酒馆，对吧？食物和饮料肯定也很贵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4a820a4c:

    # c "Ye well. I'd never say no to gold."
    c "那倒是。我可不会嫌金币多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e6f03383:

    # "You are shocked."
    "你大吃一惊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5f40b753:

    # e "Wait. Someone paid for this? Who?"
    e "等等，有人付了钱？谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d1d64d3b:

    # "Cane looks at you and chuckles."
    "凯恩看着你,笑笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d77a9ac3:

    # c "I was only pulling yer chain. Nah, this time, everything's on the house."
    c "我刚才只是在逗你。放心，这次全都算我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3c3c44dd:

    # e "Huh? You paid for this?"
    e "啊？你付的钱？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_cf7e6a9b:

    # "You cannot help but narrow your eyes. Cane is not known for his generosity with gold. You wonder if there's another angle behind this."
    "你只能把眼睛缩窄一点 凯恩的金子并不为人所知。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7d10a5e2:

    # "Suddenly, you feel a pinch on your ass."
    "突然，你感觉自己的屁股被掐了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_41794daa:

    # c "Okay. Now, get lost with the others. Yer distracting me with yer squeezy little ass."
    c "好了，现在和其他人一起滚吧。你这紧实的小屁股都让我分心了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3196f4d0:

    # e "...Fine. But I'm keeping my eyes on you."
    e "……好吧。但我会盯着你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_9bcb8791:

    # c "For what?"
    c "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4a2e982b:

    # e "...see if someone sneaked you some gold under the pocket."
    e "……看看是不是有人偷偷把金币塞到你口袋里了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b20f79fc:

    # "You quickly wiggle away from the counter."
    "你赶紧扭身离开柜台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bae4c0e7:

    # "You glance back at the side, and see a massive figure occupying the corner booth by himself."
    "你回头瞥了一眼，看到一个魁梧的身影独自占据着角落里的卡座。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_dde1637a:

    # "The air of festivity appears to stop right before touching him."
    "节庆的气氛仿佛在触碰到他之前就止步了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_196771c2:

    # "You are honestly surprised to see Rahim here considering his history with Cane."
    "你非常惊讶看到雷希姆在这里 考虑他和凯恩的历史。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6f96e3fc:

    # "However, Rahim does seem visibly uncomfortable."
    "然而,雷希姆似乎明显感到不舒服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_63feb00c:

    # "You walk over and Rahim appears to relax slightly."
    "你走过去,雷希姆似乎稍稍放松。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ca1bc323:

    # e "How's everything, Rahim?"
    e "一切还好吗,雷希姆?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5ff4e77a:

    # r "Could be better."
    r "不怎么样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_233ecfb7:

    # e "I can't believe you're here."
    e "我真不敢相信你会在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7c225574:

    # r "Me neither."
    r "我也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e84c9205:

    # "Rahim sighs and seems to take in the surroundings for the first time."
    "雷希姆叹气 似乎第一次在周围居住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7e2e1351:

    # r "It's been quite some time since I was last here."
    r "我已经很久没来这里了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a0e73d9e:

    # r "Many things have changed, but not enough."
    r "很多事情变了，但还不够。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_341b61d6:

    # "It's not hard to imagine him thinking about Cane's previous server."
    "想象他想起凯恩以前的服务器并不难。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_01593680:

    # "You try to lighten the mood."
    "你试着缓和气氛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_9bd9ed06:

    # e "Anyway, I'm thankful that you're here."
    e "不管怎样，谢谢你愿意来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bc7020a0:

    # "Rahim grunts and shrugs."
    "雷希姆的呼噜声和尖声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ffbc08b5:

    # r "Like I said, only here for the drinks."
    r "都说了，我只是来喝酒的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ce31d4d0:

    # "As if to prove his point, Rahim downs the large mug of beer."
    "似乎证明他的观点 雷希姆喝掉了一大杯啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_42092ca2:

    # r "You don't need to check in on me... But nice chat..."
    r "你不用特意来问候我……不过，聊得还不错……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_61ce4f5c:

    # r "Now, let me drink in peace."
    r "现在，让我安静地喝酒吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_aa988ec1:

    # e "Alright. Enjoy the party, Rahim!"
    e "好吧。享受派对吧,雷希姆!"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7d0ece49:

    # "As you leave, you notice the heaviness around Rahim lift slightly."
    "当你离开时,你注意到雷希姆周围的 重力有点微弱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0ca64474:

    # "At that moment, Ole saunters over and greets you."
    "在那一刻,奥利的侍卫们过来向你致意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a872175d:

    # o "You're finally here. I was worried that the courier training would have taken you days to complete."
    o "你终于来了。我还担心快递训练会花上你好几天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3cd41b4d:

    # "Ole chuckles at the joke."
    "奥利被这个笑话逗得轻笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_9650e4d4:

    # o "Okay, maybe that's too on the nose. Anyways, sorry for making you go on a wild goose chase."
    o "好吧，这玩笑也太直白了。总之，抱歉让你白忙了一场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_99d49e4f:

    # o "Seb was supposed to be the one to keep you distracted, but I had a feeling he'd fail at it."
    o "本来该由塞布负责把你支开，不过我就觉得他肯定会搞砸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6a170d2f:

    # "You think back to the many times Seb fumbled over his words this morning."
    "你回想起今天早上塞布数次说话结结巴巴的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_c29b0bd9:

    # e "You weren't wrong."
    e "你说得没错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_fe70f8e1:

    # "Ole shares a smile with you."
    "奥利朝你笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_05b142cd:

    # e "By the way, how did this come into being?"
    e "对了，这场派对是怎么筹办起来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ef051a7d:

    # o "It was all Seb's idea. He wants to have a celebration to mark your integration into Lusterfield."
    o "这是Seb的主意 他想庆祝你加入乐斯民菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_82ba5491:

    # o "He's been planning it since the first day you came..."
    o "从你来的第一天起，他就一直在筹划了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8dfaf2f0:

    # o "He talked to me about it, and I thought it was a good idea, so I helped."
    o "他跟我提过这件事，我觉得主意不错，所以就帮了忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_237b8846:

    # e "You mean, you handled the whole thing?"
    e "你的意思是，整件事都是你操办的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5f6633f8:

    # e "Like, I'm seriously doubtful that planning and Seb can go together."
    e "我实在很难相信“筹划”和塞布能扯上关系。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bcd38791:

    # "Ole laughs."
    "奥利笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_9c014427:

    # o "You undersell Sebas. Plus, it's the intention that matters. All of us came together to make this happen."
    o "你把塞巴斯说得太不堪了。而且，心意才是最重要的。我们所有人一起努力，才促成了这场派对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7154320c:

    # o "So enjoy the party. You've earned it."
    o "好好享受派对吧。这是你应得的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_09178b85:

    # "Ole pats your arm and walks away to greet another guest."
    "奥利拍拍你的手臂，走开去招呼另一位客人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d51b6a63:

    # "Suddenly, the ground beneath you trembles slightly."
    "突然，你感觉脚下的地面微微震动起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_55a533ce:

    # "You turn and see a giant stomping your way."
    "你转过身，看到一个巨人正朝你大步走来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2ff01935:

    # a "Coming through!"
    a "借过！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_cebde441:

    # "Amble is carrying many mugs in his hands. You wonder how he manages to balance them all."
    "安布手里拿着许多马克杯。你不禁纳闷他是怎么把它们全都稳住的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f15f0da3:

    # "As you move out of the way, Amble catches you and grins brightly at you."
    "当你离开时 安布抓住你 对你发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d7e2e312:

    # a "Hey, it's the dragon of the hour!"
    a "嘿，今天的主角龙！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_30750ce7:

    # "Amble stops to chat with you. Surprisingly enough, all of the drinks in his arms halt. Not one drop is spilt."
    "安布停下来和你聊天。令人惊讶的是，他臂弯里的饮料也全都稳稳停住了，一滴都没洒出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6bbae897:

    # a "Great party, isn't it? And the drinks are on the house, too!"
    a "派对很棒，对吧？而且饮料还免费！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6a5f8dde:

    # a "This is one of the happiest days of my life and it's all thanks to you!"
    a "这是我人生中最开心的日子之一，全都多亏了你！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a033b35b:

    # e "Amble, you exaggerate!"
    e "安布,你夸大了!"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_53dfa15b:

    # a "No. Really. You've brought a lot of positive changes to Lusterfield."
    a "不 真的 你给乐斯民菲尔德带来了很多积极的变化。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6e36a295:

    # a "Jog and I have more to talk about, and he doesn't seem as tense as he was before."
    a "我跟乔格还有很多话要聊，而且他看起来也没之前那么紧张了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_290eb7ef:

    # a "Lot is also smiling a... lot more these days."
    a "洛萨尔最近也比以前爱笑……多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7df63f31:

    # "You are blushing from all the compliments at this point."
    "这时，连番的夸奖让你脸红起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_98bbfc17:

    # a "Great job!"
    a "干得漂亮！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f9621dd2:

    # "While you wish to continue the conversation, Jog's voice calls over."
    "你正想继续聊下去，乔格的声音从另一边传来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8ade3785:

    # j "Amble, we're dying of thirst here!"
    j "安布，我们快渴死了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_fb612c5b:

    # a "Gotta go. Talk to you later, pal!"
    a "我得走了。回头聊，朋友！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_dabe2711:

    # "Amble trundles away to his friends."
    "安布小跑着回到朋友身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_dafb6c02:

    # "You feel a sharp gaze on you all of a sudden."
    "你突然感觉到一道锐利的目光落在自己身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0e39abe1:

    # "You look around and eventually spy the source."
    "你环顾四周，终于发现了目光的来源。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_237401ea:

    # "Haskell is sitting alone at a table, gazing at you over a familiar cup."
    "哈斯凯尔独自坐在一张桌旁，隔着那只熟悉的杯子凝视着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_39ffb917:

    # "You feel like you owe him a talk since he has traveled the furthest to this party."
    "他为了参加这场派对跋涉得最远，你觉得自己应该去和他聊聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a7275527:

    # h "This place sure is rowdy. I still prefer the quiet of the hut."
    h "这里可真吵闹。我还是更喜欢小屋里的安静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_cc401895:

    # h "Granted, there is still the occasional buggbear. Luckily, I can take them out with some sedative pretty easily."
    h "不过偶尔还是会有熊地精来闹事。好在用点镇静剂就能轻松收拾它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_031a4524:

    # h "I doubt I can do that here."
    h "我可不觉得在这里能这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_35f2d7cb:

    # "You are not sure if the dragon is being serious or not."
    "你不确定这条龙是不是在说真的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ee68b96c:

    # e "Please don't do that."
    e "请别那么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a36ac0d9:

    # "Haskell doesn't answer and takes another sip from his mug."
    "哈斯凯尔没有回答，又从马克杯里喝了一口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5d250cf4:

    # "Speaking of, you are curious about one thing."
    "说到这个，你倒是有件事很好奇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_9a59875f:

    # e "Haskell, now that we're in a tavern, are you drinking alcohol?"
    e "哈斯凯尔，既然我们在酒馆里，你喝的是酒吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_521edd78:

    # "Haskell snorts at the very idea."
    "哈斯凯尔对这个想法嗤之以鼻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_38c0d220:

    # "Haskell tips his mug to show you its contents."
    "哈斯凯尔倾斜马克杯，让你看清里面的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_61081961:

    # "It's tea as usual."
    "和往常一样，是茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_450d5a6e:

    # h "Nothing is better than tea. If I really want a buzz, there's a concoction back home that I can cook up that's much stronger than the drinks here."
    h "没有什么比茶更好。如果我真想体验醉意，家里倒是有种可以现煮的饮品，比这里的酒烈得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_76a29b7a:

    # h "Perhaps one day I'll have you try some."
    h "也许哪天我可以让你尝尝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d5436f2c:

    # "You are not sure if that's a good idea. You change the subject."
    "你不确定那是不是个好主意，于是换了个话题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0f9e6809:

    # e "Since you're here, why not get to know people? The folks at Lusterfield are nice."
    e "既然你都来了，为什么不去认识一下大家？乐斯民菲尔德的人都很友善。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3a3044c9:

    # h "I prefer my own company. Too lazy to converse."
    h "我更喜欢独处。懒得聊天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f1059366:

    # e "You're talking to me."
    e "你不是正在和我说话吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e36a089e:

    # "Haskell looks at you, takes a long drag from his mug and silence ensues...."
    "哈斯凯尔看了你一眼，深深喝了一口马克杯里的东西，随后一阵沉默……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2696a341:

    # "Point taken."
    "有道理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_727d2990:

    # "As you move around the tavern, suddenly, somebody knocks into you."
    "你在酒馆里走动时，突然有人撞了你一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_33c30286:

    # "You balance yourself on a table and right yourself."
    "你扶住桌子稳住身形，重新站好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_449fa7e4:

    # "Looking up now that you're settled, you see a shadow swaying before you."
    "你站稳后抬头看去，只见一道影子在你面前摇晃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_53861ed1:

    # "Eventually, the shadow settles into the form of Lothar."
    "最终,阴影落到洛萨尔的地步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_61524890:

    # l "Hey, who doesn't have eyes to have bumped into the hero of Lusterfield?"
    l "嘿,谁没有眼睛 撞到乐斯民菲尔德的英雄?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_90849705:

    # "You can see that Lothar's face is flushed from inebriation."
    "你可以看到,洛萨尔的脸 被从醉酒中冲洗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d8cb6bde:

    # "As you are about to apologize, Lothar's eyes focus."
    "当你即将道歉的时候 洛萨尔的目光聚焦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_c47a7375:

    # l "Oh! It's my Disciple! Good... Party you got there."
    l "哦！是我的弟子！这……派对办得不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_33689d32:

    # l "Hu...hmm... Can you stop moving?"
    l "呼……嗯……你能别动吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5968e5bf:

    # "You are standing perfectly still. It is Lothar who is swaying on his unsteady feet."
    "你明明站得稳稳的，摇晃的却是脚步不稳的洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_aecf7681:

    # e "Lothar, you're drunk. You better sit down and rest."
    e "洛萨尔,你喝醉了,你最好坐下休息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_648ae6c5:

    # l "Nonsense! The hero is never drunk! This is nothing for me."
    l "胡说！英雄才不会醉！这点酒算不了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7e8c7ae6:

    # l "In fact, I can down another 100 mugs of beer!"
    l "事实上，我还能再喝一百杯啤酒！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8b86d4ff:

    # "You move to help steady Lothar."
    "您移动来帮助稳定的洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0cc34fee:

    # l "I'm fine, Disciple! Don't underestimate the Hero."
    l "我没事，弟子！别小看英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d7e16e07:

    # l "I just need to clear my mind for a moment, and I'll be back for more."
    l "我只需要先清醒一下，马上就回来继续喝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0ea0e49e:

    # "Before you can stop him, Lothar shuffles away, teetering on his feet."
    "在你阻止他之前,洛萨尔洗手间 被他脚踩得半死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_96f02f27:

    # "You hope that he won't bump into anything dangerous, like Seb."
    "希望他别撞上什么危险的东西，比如塞布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5c660fd9:

    # "That would be an incendiary scene."
    "那可就要上演一出火爆场面了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8feeb2d5:

    # "You look around the tavern and notice that a person is missing."
    "你环顾酒馆，发现少了一个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_773dcb7c:

    # "However, you know that he has to be here because his friends are here, and because you heard him ask for beer earlier, so you look closer."
    "不过，他的朋友们都在这里，而且你之前还听到他要啤酒，所以你确定他一定在酒馆里，便仔细找了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b0bbbdb2:

    # "Finally, you spot a fleeting shadow near the back of the tavern, where the boxes are stacked."
    "最后，你在酒馆后方堆放箱子的地方，瞥见一道一闪而过的影子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b434ff06:

    # "You move towards it."
    "你朝那道影子走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1d6ca331:

    # j "Well. Fancy seeing you here."
    j "嗯，真没想到会在这里见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_80948863:

    # "Jog leans against a box casually, holding a mug in his hand."
    "乔格随意地靠在箱子上，手里拿着一只马克杯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e51b6c75:

    # e "Why aren't you out there with the crowd?"
    e "你怎么没和大家一起待在外面？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_abb59e47:

    # e "I was expecting you out there..."
    e "我还以为你会在那里呢……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6e99fa0a:

    # j "Where did you think I got this drink from?"
    j "不然你以为我这杯酒是从哪儿来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5897d8c6:

    # "Jog tips back the whole mug."
    "乔格仰头把整杯酒一饮而尽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4736e82c:

    # "His face isn't flushed at all. It is as if the alcohol has no effect on him."
    "他的脸一点也没红，好像酒精对他不起作用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_861aecef:

    # e "You sure know how to handle your liquor."
    e "你还真能喝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a2b6c8f3:

    # j "Why, thank you for the compliment."
    j "哦，谢谢夸奖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5bd78bcd:

    # j "A scout has to stay vigilant at all times. Plus, someone has to be clear-headed to take care of Lot and the blockhead."
    j "斥候必须时刻保持警惕。而且总得有人保持清醒，好照看洛萨尔和那个木头脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5cd86f9a:

    # e "That's very thoughtful of you."
    e "你真体贴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3509d474:

    # "This time, there's some redness on Jog's cheeks."
    "这一次，乔格的脸颊染上了一抹红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_c7fad96d:

    # j "Eh. Someone has to do it."
    j "呃，总得有人来做这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_735f57bf:

    # j "Anyway, this has been fun. I'll have to go grab another beer. It's not everyday that I can swipe one from the counter without the barkeep glaring at me."
    j "总之，今天挺开心的。我得再去拿杯啤酒。不是每天都有机会趁酒保不注意从柜台顺走一杯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_47a0e649:

    # "With that, Jog slips away into the shadows."
    "说完，乔格悄悄隐入阴影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a60b4213:

    # "Suddenly, you feel someone hug you from behind."
    "突然，你感觉有人从背后抱住了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d9e856d1:

    # "It's very warm."
    "暖烘烘的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_c71007be:

    # s "Roomie! I've finally caught you!"
    s "室友！我终于抓到你了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a9155662:

    # e "I'm not going anywhere."
    e "我哪儿也没打算去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d49b879d:

    # s "You were so busy talking to others that I thought I'd come to you instead."
    s "你一直忙着和别人聊天，所以我就来找你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f074cde0:

    # s "Surprise!"
    s "惊喜！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f0c4831d:

    # "Seb chuckles. His fur tickles you."
    "塞布轻笑起来。他的毛蹭得你发痒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bd0a640c:

    # "Seb lets you go and grins at you."
    "塞布松开你，冲你咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_69d4cdc2:

    # e "Seb, thanks for throwing this party for me."
    e "塞布，谢谢你为我办这场派对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ac75a288:

    # s "Roomie, you deserve it. After everything you've done for Lusterfield, this is the least we can do!"
    s "室友,你应得的,你为乐斯民菲尔德做了这么多事！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_445e834b:

    # s "Plus, you've done a lot for me too."
    s "再说，你也为我做了很多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_904c7f03:

    # s "With you around, the time I spend working at the shop is not as boring."
    s "有你在身边，我在店里工作的时间也没那么无聊了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_80a79a76:

    # s "Plus, I get to hear stories of your adventures too!"
    s "而且我还能听你讲冒险故事！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_08ccbcaf:

    # s "And you're the only person to appreciate the shop sign that I've made."
    s "你还是唯一一个欣赏我做的店铺招牌的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3020c6e4:

    # s "You've done so much for me and everyone else!"
    s "你为我和其他所有人做了这么多！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e2105d7b:

    # s "Roomie, you're the best!"
    s "室友，你最好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d04a3ac7:

    # e "Seb, you're the best too!"
    e "塞布，你也最好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5c9598d2:

    # e "If you didn't rescue me back at the forest, I wouldn't have met so many amazing people."
    e "要不是你在森林里救了我，我就不会认识这么多了不起的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ca7ac8a8:

    # s "Aww, Roomie. You're going to make me blush."
    s "哎呀，室友。你都快把我夸脸红了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_15487d1f:

    # s "But enough of the sappy stuff. Today we're here to celebrate. Go grab some drinks!"
    s "好了，煽情的话就说到这里。今天是庆祝的日子。去拿点饮料吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a243f93c:

    # "And the party ensues."
    "派对继续进行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7fbf9e7b:

    # "As the party continues, people break up and form different groups."
    "随着派对继续，大家三三两两分成了不同的小团体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_828f6d69:

    # "It's rare for people to have a chance to gather like this."
    "很少有人能有机会这样聚在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_617e8a7c:

    # "Some are taking this chance to get to know new friends, others to solve old rivalries."
    "有人借机认识新朋友，也有人借机解决旧日的恩怨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d463a872:

    # "You hear an argument coming from somewhere in the tavern."
    "你听到酒馆某处传来争吵声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e9aa9adb:

    # "Lothar and Sebas are arguing. Haskell remains seated at his table, sipping his tea."
    "洛萨尔和塞巴斯在争吵 哈斯凯尔坐在桌子上喝茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_fa07fad2:

    # s "How drunk must you get that you can't even watch your step anymore?"
    s "你得醉成什么样，才连路都不会看了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3fb6a2b5:

    # l "Shut it, lion! I'm not even drunk! Stop finding excuses to fight with me."
    l "闭嘴，狮子！我根本没醉！别再找借口跟我打架。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6f1b5df5:

    # "A low growl rumbles from Seb's throat."
    "塞布喉咙里滚出一声低沉的咆哮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bd1fbdf5:

    # "Lothar's face is still red but it's no longer due to alcohol, but anger."
    "洛萨尔的脸还是红的 但不再是因为酒精 而是愤怒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_de303ce3:

    # "You hurry over to mediate before a fight breaks out."
    "你赶紧过去，在打起来之前调解。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bf31023a:

    # s "Why are you even here?"
    s "你到底来这里干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_858bba14:

    # l "Do you think I want to be here? I'm not even here for you."
    l "你以为我想来这里吗？我又不是为了你才来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4fbc5639:

    # s "Then leave! And take your lackeys with you."
    s "那就滚！带着你的跟班一起滚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2ea3629b:

    # l "Hey, lion! Watch it! It's one thing to come after me but it's another to insult my mates."
    l "嘿，狮子！说话注意点！冲着我来是一回事，侮辱我的伙伴又是另一回事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_20c2d1ca:

    # s "Did I get anything wrong? I can't say I'm surprised. Criminals stick together."
    s "我说错什么了吗？我一点都不意外。罪犯总是抱团。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8549f672:

    # l "You take that back!"
    l "你把话收回去！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_fbd831c4:

    # s "Make me."
    s "有本事你就让我收回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_cdd06efb:

    # "Lothar's coat bristles with tension."
    "洛萨尔的衣帽 紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_693effac:

    # "Seb also moves in place to counter."
    "塞布也挪动脚步，摆出应战的架势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_694f257b:

    # "As you are about to burst through to the center to stop them, there is a heavy slam on the table."
    "你正要冲到中间阻止他们，桌子上突然传来一声沉重的砰响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a1cdcab5:

    # "It stops both Lothar and Sebas."
    "它停止了洛萨尔和塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_de5edade:

    # "All of you turn to the source."
    "你们全都转向声音传来的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4eb6c8e0:

    # "Haskell has slammed his mug on the table and there's a dangerous glint in his eyes."
    "哈斯凯尔把马克杯重重砸在桌上，眼中闪过危险的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0c490794:

    # "Then, he breaks into a smile that doesn't quite reach his eyes."
    "然后，他露出一个笑容，却没有半点笑意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_72f985b0:

    # h "Boys, why don't we calm down? How about some tea to ease the hot blood?"
    h "小伙子们，何不冷静一下？喝点茶，消消火怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f28fc048:

    # h "All this chaos is making it difficult for me to enjoy my tea in peace."
    h "你们这么闹腾，我都没法安静地喝茶了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a7dc9867:

    # h "Plus, are you sure you want to do this with the guest of honor standing right there?"
    h "再说，你们确定要当着主宾的面打起来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f4cf5735:

    # "Haskell points at you."
    "哈斯凯尔指了指你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_fef94c3b:

    # "Lothar and Sebas turn to look at you. Both of them immediately flush red with shame."
    "洛萨尔和塞巴斯转身看你,他们俩都立即羞耻地冲红了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_98f0697c:

    # "They put away their aggression immediately."
    "他们立刻收起了敌意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_eb595b79:

    # s "He... he's right. This is a party."
    s "他……他说得对。这是派对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b4a5c4eb:

    # s "I'm sorry about that, [e]."
    s "抱歉，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6f74433f:

    # "Before you can say anything, Seb turns and walks away."
    "你还没来得及说话，塞布就转身走开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_c7304d11:

    # "At the same time, Lother grumbles under his breath."
    "与此同时，洛萨尔低声咕哝起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b6aa873d:

    # l "You got lucky this time, Lion."
    l "这次算你走运，狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_201be4d6:

    # "Lothar glares at Haskell and then at you before stalking away."
    "哈斯凯尔的洛萨尔画画 然后在你跟踪之前就对你画画。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_cd3512f4:

    # "You are quite flustered. You have no idea what to do and who to chase after."
    "你窘迫极了，完全不知道该做什么，也不知道该去追谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3e912f38:

    # "Unexpectedly, Haskell speaks again."
    "出乎意料的是，哈斯凯尔再次开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1222a168:

    # h "Hold your horses, young courier."
    h "慢着，小快递员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6088d047:

    # h "Take this old dragon's advice. Give them some time to chill. You going to them now will only reignite the fire."
    h "听听这条老龙的建议。给他们一点时间冷静下来。你现在过去，只会让火头重新燃起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3abe1073:

    # e "They're really angry... I-I don't know what to do."
    e "他们真的很生气……我、我不知道该怎么办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_558480a2:

    # h "Certain things are easier to handle when one's mind is not clouded by anger. This is not the occasion to strike while the fire is hot."
    h "有些事，等头脑不再被愤怒蒙蔽后会更容易处理。现在不是趁热打铁的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2fded262:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_32f3c0b9:

    # h "This is why I hate social functions."
    h "所以我才讨厌社交活动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5407749e:

    # "Haskell resumes sipping his tea."
    "哈斯凯尔继续啜饮他的茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_aec30422:

    # "You ponder over his advice and agree, deciding to give both parties some time to cool down."
    "你思考着他的建议，觉得有道理，于是决定给双方一些冷静的时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_455bbbc0:

    # "You notice Ole and Jog seated at a secluded corner of the tavern, away from prying eyes."
    "你当看见奥利和约格坐在酒馆的密处,远离眼界。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_74e9f746:

    # "You do not interrupt them for they seem like they need privacy."
    "你没有打扰他们，毕竟他们看起来需要一点私人空间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_df787263:

    # "As you start to walk away, their conversation drifts over and into your ears."
    "你正准备离开时，他们的谈话飘进了你的耳朵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b5d2e528:

    # o "It has been a long time... since we could talk like this."
    o "已经很久……没有这样聊过了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_998b6302:

    # j "You're right about that."
    j "你说得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e00064a9:

    # "The usual cheekiness in Jog's voice is gone. It is rife with shame."
    "乔格语气中一贯的轻佻消失了，取而代之的是浓重的羞愧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_43ab1d3a:

    # "You know it is wrong but you can't help but stop moving. You want to know more."
    "你知道偷听不对，却还是忍不住停下脚步。你想知道更多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_50926701:

    # o "How have you been?"
    o "你最近过得怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0fe6a8c7:

    # j "Not bad. Hanging out with Boss and Amble is fun. What about you?"
    j "不错,跟老板和安布玩玩很好玩 你呢?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a87606ae:

    # o "It's the usual back at the shop. But we have a new roommate living with us there."
    o "店里还是老样子。不过现在有一位新室友和我们住在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_32b3b7d3:

    # j "Yes, the new courier. That one's some nice eye-candy."
    j "对，就是那个新来的快递员。那家伙可真养眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_61963365:

    # "There is a temporary silence."
    "一阵短暂的沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7b13f5e8:

    # j "Oh. Don't tell me you haven't noticed?"
    j "哦，别告诉我你没注意到？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d0c65a1d:

    # o "Jog, you still haven't changed, have you?"
    o "乔格，你还是一点没变，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f1fd9884:

    # j "Why should I? There's only one person who wants me to change anyway."
    j "我为什么要变？反正也只有一个人希望我改变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_df187730:

    # j "Speaking of, how's your lion friend?"
    j "说到这个，你那位狮子朋友怎么样了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b4e07485:

    # o "Jog, this is a happy occasion. Do you have to bring that up?"
    o "乔格，今天是开心的日子。你非要提这个吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_76ee8cc2:

    # "Ole sighs."
    "奥利叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_003faafb:

    # j "It's rather hard to do that when your friend has been giving me the evil eye all night."
    j "你那位朋友整晚都在用阴沉的目光瞪我，我实在很难开心起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4619d871:

    # o "Don't say that. Plus, he is your friend too."
    o "别这么说。他也是你的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_97f132e6:

    # j "No. Was. The friendship was over once he accused me."
    j "不。曾经是。自从他指控我之后，我们就绝交了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4c4cf9fa:

    # o "You didn't give him much choice."
    o "是你没给他选择的余地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6816fcd9:

    # j "Now, what does that mean?"
    j "你这话是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_07160879:

    # o "You know..."
    o "你知道的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6f00431d:

    # "Jog's voice hikes up a bit."
    "乔格的声音提高了几分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_07080dd2:

    # j "No, I don't."
    j "不，我不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8344c03b:

    # o "If you hadn't swiped the merchandise from the counter, Seb wouldn..."
    o "如果你没有从柜台偷走那些货物，塞布他就不会……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f2fa8e80:

    # j "I'm going to stop you right there."
    j "你就说到这里吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0b838d48:

    # j "I did no such thing. Yes, I have a sketchy background but I would never steal from my friends."
    j "我没做过那种事。没错，我的背景不太光彩，但我绝不会偷朋友的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_77556847:

    # o "But the evidence..."
    o "可证据……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_04d73cd3:

    # j "I told you they're false. Also... Ole... I haven't really heard from you. Do you believe me? Did you think I did it?"
    j "我说过那是假的。而且……奥利……我最近几乎没听到你的消息。你相信我吗？你觉得是我做的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_966cf34c:

    # o "I..."
    o "我……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1497bdb1:

    # "Ole sputters."
    "奥利支支吾吾起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_76d8dc40:

    # j "This is unbelievable."
    j "真不敢相信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1c8a73ed:

    # "Jog sounds frustrated. He sounds like he's about to storm off."
    "乔格听起来很沮丧，仿佛马上就要拂袖离去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bf5e3df7:

    # "At that moment, Amble lumbers over."
    "那一刻,安布木材倒塌了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ffb6f7e7:

    # a "Hey friends! Jog, where are you going? I just got us a brand new round."
    a "嘿，朋友们！乔格，你要去哪儿？我刚拿来了新一轮的酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_196ef572:

    # "Amble pushes Jog back down into his seat, and places the mugs of beer on the table."
    "安布把乔格按回座位，又把几只啤酒杯放到桌上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d0bccf5e:

    # a "Hey Ole! Great party, isn't it?"
    a "嘿,奥利!"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bfea6e77:

    # a "Here, a beer for you too!"
    a "来，也给你一杯啤酒！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_cedef752:

    # "Amble stumbles into the awkward situation with a charming insensitivity that only he can manage."
    "安布带着只有他才有的、讨人喜欢却毫无察觉的迟钝，跌跌撞撞地闯进这尴尬场面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_eca9a72b:

    # "Then, Amble leans over to Ole and whispers in a voice that is no quieter than normal."
    "然后,安布俯向奥利,低声低语,低语的声调,无比平凡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_12a25423:

    # a "Also, is there something wrong with your lion friend's eyes?"
    a "对了，你那位狮子朋友的眼睛是不是出什么问题了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0fe90e0b:

    # a "He has been giving us a look out of the corner of his eyes all night. Perhaps he needs to get them checked? I'm worried about him."
    a "他整晚都在用眼角瞥我们。也许他该去检查一下眼睛？我有点担心他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bd675e97:

    # "Ole doesn't quite know how to respond, and Jog cuts in."
    "奥利一时不知道该怎么回答，乔格便插了进来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5aa3d153:

    # j "Amb, you've probably just been imagining it. I didn't notice anything like that."
    j "安布，你可能只是看错了。我没注意到什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_021b33ec:

    # "Amble scratches his head innocently."
    "安布无辜地挠了挠头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b386f596:

    # a "Really? Perhaps you're right then."
    a "真的吗？那可能是你说得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_704d45ca:

    # a "But no matter. The important thing is that we're with friends."
    a "不过没关系。重要的是我们和朋友们在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a3427d44:

    # "Amble raises his mug to cheer Jog and Ole."
    "安布举起杯子来为乔格和奥利欢呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_56b38c2b:

    # "You decide to leave the three alone."
    "你决定把他们三个单独留下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8329aa5c:

    # "As the party dies down a bit, Cane has some time to relax."
    "当派对稍稍消逝时 凯恩有时间放松一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_9eb92065:

    # "You see him leave the counter and take the seat across from Rahim."
    "你看见他离开柜台 坐雷希姆对面的座位。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_56d65eff:

    # "Instantly, the tension in the air is palpable."
    "空气中的紧张感顿时清晰可感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3b7b1b80:

    # "You don't interfere for you know they have something to work out."
    "你没有插手，因为你知道他们有些事情需要自己解决。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5ea21c00:

    # c "Thanks for coming over."
    c "谢谢你过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bfedc997:

    # "You notice Cane dropped his usual accent... around Rahim."
    "你注意到凯恩在雷希姆周围 掉了他平常的口音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_c448a33d:

    # r "Didn't do it for you."
    r "又不是为了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2e1757f9:

    # c "Regardless, it means a lot."
    c "不管怎样，这对我意义重大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_84560a66:

    # "For once, Cane sounds sincere."
    "就这一次,凯恩听起来很真诚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_336e50b5:

    # r "Hmm."
    r "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1874b699:

    # c "Look. I'm sorry about what happened to Topu."
    c "听着，托普的事……我很抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e6d1fa72:

    # "Rahim's grip on the mug tightens."
    "雷希姆握紧了杯子紧身衣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3d1c86bd:

    # c "I didn't know the kid would act so recklessly."
    c "我没想到那孩子会如此鲁莽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3b1ad0c1:

    # "Rahim still doesn't say anything."
    "雷希姆还是什么也不说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_9aad5668:

    # c "I care about the kid as much as you do."
    c "我跟你一样在乎那孩子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e6be7679:

    # "Rahim snorts."
    "雷希姆鼻涕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3c1267c3:

    # r "If that were true, he'd still be here."
    r "如果真是这样，他现在就不会不在这里了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_14db6a4f:

    # "Cane chokes on his words and looks down in silence and guilt."
    "凯恩话到嘴边又咽了回去，沉默而愧疚地低下头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b40b28d0:

    # "After a while, Cane resumes speaking."
    "过了一段时间,凯恩又恢复说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d01bce8a:

    # c "For what it's worth.... I'm sorry."
    c "不管有没有用……我很抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5d0a56ef:

    # "Rahim pauses and then takes another sip of beer."
    "雷希姆停下来 再喝一瓶啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5564863a:

    # r "You owe him an apology, not me."
    r "你该向他道歉，而不是向我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_9ed02f0e:

    # "Then, there is a stretch of silence."
    "随后是一段漫长的沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_239871e5:

    # r "...Your beer still tastes like shit."
    r "……你的啤酒尝起来还是跟狗屎一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_cf6c2e74:

    # "Cane cracks a small smile."
    "凯恩露出一丝浅笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_334eb7e1:

    # c "People like the swill."
    c "有人就喜欢这种劣酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b373c25b:

    # c "Speaking of, I better get back to work."
    c "说到这个，我得回去干活了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_03379219:

    # "Before he leaves, you notice Cane turns back to Rahim."
    "在他离开之前 你注意到凯恩回雷希姆了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8632c483:

    # c "I mean it, it's good to see you here."
    c "我是认真的，见到你在这里真好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3428f076:

    # "You leave the groups to their own business..."
    "你不再打扰他们，让各个小团体继续做自己的事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_86e445aa:

    # "You look at your friends scattered around the tavern. People that wouldn't have interacted are now gathered under one room."
    "你看着散落在酒馆各处的朋友们。原本不会有交集的人，如今全都聚在了同一个屋檐下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d2caea30:

    # "Haskell and Amble are conversing about the different properties of tea."
    "哈斯凯尔和安布在谈论茶的不同特性。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2a8e5558:

    # "You swear you can see stars on Amble's head. Most of the details must have flown over him but he's too polite to leave the conversation."
    "你发誓你可以看到安布头上的星星 大部分细节都飞过他身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_76ffe968:

    # "Jog crosses path with Seb. Jog slithers away but not out of fear but more like a refusal to engage in meaningless argument."
    "乔格和塞布擦肩而过。乔格滑行着离开，并不是因为害怕，而是不想参与无意义的争论。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2e057aea:

    # "Seb merely glared at Jog as the latter moves away. You have never seen your roommate act like this before."
    "塞布只是瞪着乔格离开。你以前从没见过室友这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ddd31595:

    # "Rahim is trying to fend off a persistent Lothar who is aiming to finagle a new armor from Rahim."
    "雷希姆正试图击退一个坚持的洛萨尔人 他正试图从雷希姆那里 挖出一支新的盔甲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_87318319:

    # "Rahim's refusal is firm and affirmative. That doesn't quite faze the Hero of Lusterfield even though he does appear more cowed around Rahim."
    "雷希姆的拒绝是坚定和肯定的。这并不能让乐斯民菲尔德的英雄化为灰烬,尽管他似乎更害怕雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8850cbb3:

    # "Ole and Cane are chatting over the counter. You believe Ole is trying to negotiate a business deal to have Cane sell some of his food and drinks at the shop."
    "奥利和凯恩在柜台聊天,你相信奥利想谈生意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2e6eeaa4:

    # "Even during this occasion, Ole is trying to help out Seb. You hope they can reach a consensus that is beneficial to both parties."
    "即使在这样的场合，奥利仍在努力帮助塞布。你希望他们能达成对双方都有利的共识。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b77d0579:

    # "It seems the party is still going strong..."
    "看来派对还在热闹地继续……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_dae9e376:

    # "Soon, Jog and Lothar went over to Cane for beer."
    "很快,乔格和洛萨尔就去凯恩喝啤酒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_43065f43:

    # "Amble is joining in with Sebas, Rahim and Ole on the other table."
    "安布和塞巴斯、雷希姆和奥利在另一张桌子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_fde1872d:

    # "And Haskell... seems to be looking over at the exit."
    "而哈斯凯尔……似乎一直在看出口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a58bdbfb:

    # l "That lion... he's... never going to learn isn't he..."
    l "那头狮子……他……就是学不会，对吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_00fd5b3d:

    # j "I know..."
    j "我知道……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_896ce127:

    # "You walk towards the three across the bar, and join in with the group."
    "你穿过酒吧朝三人走去，加入了他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_00fd5b3d_1:

    # j "I know..."
    j "我知道……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2701bc76:

    # c "Cut him some slack, ya dink donks."
    c "对他宽容点，你们这两个笨蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5498cc85:

    # c "Hey, good to see you, my lad. Take a seat."
    c "嘿，小伙子，见到你真好。坐吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_af0fe8aa:

    # e "H-hey! What are you talking about?"
    e "喂、喂！你们在说什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_89154f0e:

    # l "Your 'Roommate', I suspect he's got some problems in the head."
    l "你的“室友”，我看他脑子有点问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_12876c99:

    # l "I just don't understand why someone would be so obsessed about fucking over Jog like that."
    l "我就是不明白，为什么有人会这么执着于整乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8b78b404:

    # e "Uh...?"
    e "呃……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d2d0ea74:

    # l "I gave him a fair punishment after that, and now? he's obsessed with kicking my balls."
    l "我那次给了他应有的惩罚，而现在呢？他居然一心想着踢我的蛋蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7384b8dc:

    # c "Maybe if ya didn't do it to him in the first place."
    c "也许你一开始没那么对他，他就不会这样了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2915be4f:

    # c "[e], a beer?"
    c "[e]，来杯啤酒？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_547bd8c7:

    # e "Y-yes please."
    e "好、好的，谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_01850e49:

    # l "You're living with him, disciple."
    l "你可是和他住在一起的，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e71069e8:

    # l "Be careful when you sleep, you'll find the lion staring at you in the middle of the night."
    l "睡觉时小心点，半夜你可能会发现那头狮子正盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0e04b6c8:

    # j "Lot..."
    j "洛萨尔……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_dbbefa0e:

    # c "Here's your beer, [e]."
    c "这是你的啤酒，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1a3db3bd:

    # c "And ya two, change the subject."
    c "你们两个，换个话题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6b342fbf:

    # l "What?"
    l "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_11c6bc8b:

    # c "Ya wanna keep bumming out my lad at his own party?"
    c "你们想在他自己的派对上继续让我的小伙子扫兴吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_82822a0c:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1d1304e5:

    # j "I've got a good one, I was walking down the road last week, and I found that elk."
    j "我来讲个有意思的。上周我走在路上，发现了那头麋鹿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4498a5ed:

    # l "W-who?"
    l "谁、谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_c126b7ca:

    # j "The elk. He's near the werewolves' den."
    j "那头麋鹿。他就在狼人巢穴附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7543ea61:

    # c "Huh?"
    c "啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_761ec58e:

    # c "Where did ya find him?"
    c "你在哪儿发现他的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8fa1c0d3:

    # j "I just told you, Cane. How about you, have you seen the elk?"
    j "凯恩,我刚刚告诉你了,你见过那只骆驼吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_074cf3cf:

    # e "Hmm, no."
    e "嗯，不去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_dc911871:

    # j "Sad. He's got such a fat cock hanging down there."
    j "可惜。他那家伙下面垂着一根好大的鸡巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a878cebf:

    # e "...what?"
    e "……什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_cdf71f1b:

    # l "Ok, your time's up, change the subject."
    l "好了，你的时间到了，换个话题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ae2dbd46:

    # j "H-hey I've not finished yet."
    j "喂、喂！我还没讲完呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2b8d8c21:

    # l "Spotlight's yours, disciple. What's with you and that friend you were talking about?"
    l "聚光灯交给你了，弟子。你和刚才提到的那个朋友是怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2b40a022:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_72dea9dd:

    # l "I forgot his name."
    l "我忘了他的名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_dd637aaf:

    # c "Chime?"
    c "齐门?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1ccbe73b:

    # c "I got it from the lion."
    c "我从那头狮子那里知道的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e3835711:

    # e "He... I don't know. I have no idea where he went."
    e "他……我不知道。我完全不知道他去哪儿了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_cbd69bac:

    # j "He's up the mountain, no?"
    j "他在山上，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_755e51eb:

    # e "I... I hope so."
    e "我……我希望是吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bfe3511b:

    # e "To be honest, I'm really grateful for all of you around here. It wasn't always like this in my own tribe."
    e "说实话，我真的很感激身边有你们。在我自己的部族里，情况可从来不是这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_66dadafc:

    # e "...Only Chime was there for me then."
    e "……那时只有奇姆愿意陪着我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_628d04ef:

    # e "I'm not even sure if I want to go back if I get the chance to."
    e "就算有机会，我也不确定自己想不想回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ff4e37c4:

    # c "Lad..."
    c "小伙子……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a8d5791c:

    # "You can feel Cane struggling with his words. Almost as if he has been through something similar once already."
    "你可以感觉到凯恩的言语在挣扎,几乎好像他曾经经历过类似的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8a3af9e6:

    # j "You can stay as long as you want."
    j "你想待多久都可以。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f0d39886:

    # l "What's wrong with your tribe and all anyway. I, as a hero, have never seen something like this."
    l "你的部族到底怎么了？我这个英雄可从没见过这种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7c308f08:

    # l "I don't even know where you're from."
    l "我甚至不知道你来自哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8d9a5049:

    # l "Lizard says you're from another world."
    l "那只蜥蜴说你来自另一个世界。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_61943e79:

    # l "But... what if you're just from somewhere far far away...?"
    l "但是……你会不会只是来自某个非常非常遥远的地方……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5f5eb8e2:

    # e "I don't know. The trees... they look so similar to the ones I saw when I met that monster."
    e "我不知道。那些树……和我遇到那头怪物时看到的树太像了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d379a158:

    # j "Ah, what if you just fell into a deep slumber for a long time. Like, say a hundred centuries."
    j "啊，说不定你只是陷入了长久的沉睡。比如说，一百个世纪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_175cfdc7:

    # l "That doesn't even make sense, Jog."
    l "这根本说不通，乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bc5e97ef:

    # c "I suggest ya go check on that monster of yers. We have no idea where yer sleazy ass came from."
    c "我建议你去看看你说的那头怪物。我们可不知道你这个不三不四的家伙到底从哪儿冒出来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3bcb8f0e:

    # j "By the way, everything's been freaking out since you and your friend came along."
    j "顺便说，自从你和你的朋友来了之后，所有事情都变得乱七八糟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_324b8eb3:

    # j "The goats and their stolen runes, and the bears... I heard from Amble that they started acting weird around the same time as well."
    j "山羊族和他们偷走的符文，还有那些熊……我听安布说，它们差不多也是在同一时间开始变得奇怪的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4e8a9bd4:

    # l "The goats got what they had coming to them."
    l "山羊族是自作自受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_66aaefde:

    # l "Disciple, now that I look at you, you do look like a goat."
    l "弟子，现在仔细看看你，你确实长得像只山羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_c1d8c2a9:

    # e "Uhh? What?"
    e "呃？什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d65b7a8a:

    # l "The horns and stuff. Must be a different world thing."
    l "角啊之类的。一定是不同世界的缘故。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_eaa0d76c:

    # c "Nah, this lad's more like a dragon. Didn't that potion maker have fur also."
    c "不，这小伙子更像一条龙。那个药剂师不也长着毛吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_95c401e2:

    # j "I would still expect some scales on a proper dragon."
    j "真正的龙身上还是应该有鳞片的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7397327b:

    # "You feel a little awkward letting the three to discuss your look. So you decide to withdraw yourself from the table."
    "让他们三个讨论你的外表，你感觉有些尴尬。于是你决定离开这张桌子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_76f75a79:

    # e "...I think I should go, I've drank enough beer."
    e "……我想我该走了，我已经喝够啤酒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_425e497e:

    # c "H-hey! Lad... something wrong?"
    c "喂、喂！小伙子……出什么事了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_44217118:

    # e "N-no... just don't want to get too drunk."
    e "不、不是……我只是不想醉得太厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7281bbd7:

    # "You walk towards the table and notices Amble standing there as well."
    "你走到桌子边 发现安布也站在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_800cfb98:

    # a "Hey...I'm getting tired, mind if I join you three?"
    a "嘿……我有点累了，可以和你们三个一起坐吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8aa5e4b9:

    # s "Sure Amb, Rahim vouched for you."
    s "当然是Amb,雷希姆为你担保。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_db83bd51:

    # a "Ha- Thanks."
    a "哈——谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_99ea73ce:

    # o "Hey! [e], come and take a seat!"
    o "嘿！[e]，过来坐吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3388a208:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "哦……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b7b15969:

    # o "We're just chatting."
    o "我们只是在聊天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6093664d:

    # e "Thank you for throwing me a party by the way."
    e "对了，谢谢你为我办这场派对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_74e19fe3:

    # s "No, thanks for being here with us."
    s "不，该谢谢你愿意和我们一起待着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_854184a7:

    # s "You've been a good roomie all along!"
    s "你一直都是个好室友！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ad7d64e6:

    # a "Hey... Seb, what's wrong with your ey-"
    a "喂……塞布，你的眼睛怎么——"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_12f45411:

    # "You notice Ole elbow Amble in the ribs."
    "你看见肋骨上有奥利肘骨的安布吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8f0f392e:

    # a "Ah... what?"
    a "啊……什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a9211883:

    # o "Ehem! So, [e], how's the party?"
    o "咳嗯！那么，[e]，派对怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_17ca912b:

    # e "Uh... good? I'm just glad we're all coming together today."
    e "呃……不错？我只是很高兴今天大家能聚在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7122cb54:

    # o "I agree, we should all come together more often."
    o "我也这么觉得，我们应该多聚聚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7c586493:

    # o "Anyways, Seb and Rahim were playing chess upstairs the other day."
    o "总之 赛伯和雷希姆那天在楼上下棋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_6a8fe6b7:

    # o "Maybe you should join in some time?"
    o "也许你哪天也可以来参加？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_eb26774b:

    # e "What's chess?"
    e "国际象棋是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_35407981:

    # o "You've got some pawns, a king, a queen, a-"
    o "有兵、国王、王后，还有——"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f4f0b94a:

    # a "A pawn and a king? So that's where the name of your shop came from."
    a "兵和国王？原来你的店名就是这么来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1f2fac05:

    # o "Yes, Seb liked to start the game with the pawn in front of his king."
    o "对，塞布喜欢让国王前面的兵先开局。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_bbfec0f6:

    # o "And Rahim starts with the queen's pawn."
    o "雷希姆从女王的卒子开始。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_de0be363:

    # r "Look, theoretically queen's pawn gets you more advantages as white."
    r "听着，理论上白方走后翼兵能获得更多优势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_cd574b7c:

    # s "No, not in practice, Rahim. I've won twice as often as you."
    s "不,实际上不是,雷希姆,我比你赢得多两倍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0a9fec8c:

    # r "Ugh... That's because you always cheat with your weird rules about the pawn."
    r "唉……那是因为你总是靠那些关于兵的奇怪规则作弊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_41f2d48c:

    # s "That's en passant."
    s "这是“吃过路兵”。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_b173f8d5:

    # e "I don't understand a single word..."
    e "我一个字都听不懂……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3019bbe6:

    # s "Buddy, you'll understand when I teach you about the amazing world of chess."
    s "伙计，等我教你认识国际象棋的奇妙世界，你就明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_114f75f9:

    # a "Can I learn too?"
    a "我也能学吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_66d43ed5:

    # s "Amb, you sure you don't want to join Lothar instead?"
    s "你确定你不想加入洛萨尔吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_03c0ed9f:

    # a "They're all talking about their own stuff today. Plus I've never seen chess before."
    a "今天大家都在聊自己的事。而且我以前从没见过国际象棋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_36146446:

    # a "Sounds like something straight from the town."
    a "听起来像是从城里直接搬来的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_721b7c6f:

    # s "Fine, you can join as well."
    s "好吧，你也可以加入。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_fef4dd9d:

    # a "Great."
    a "太好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2e051382:

    # "You see Sebas stop giving Amble the evil eye. He still continues giving it to Lothar and Jog."
    "你看,塞巴斯停止把邪恶的眼珠给安布,他仍然把它给洛萨尔和约格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a31c0f4a:

    # e "I think I should go now."
    e "我想我现在该走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_e047a6c6:

    # e "Just to see how the others are doing."
    e "去看看其他人怎么样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d6e0aa03:

    # s "Oh take care! [e]."
    s "哦，保重！[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2029a940:

    # "You politely stand up from your seat and leave the four to their own discussion."
    "你礼貌地起身离开，让四人继续讨论。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_94487300:

    # "You see Haskell head towards the door. You quickly chase after him."
    "你看到哈斯凯尔朝门口走去，赶紧追了上去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_1cc9e780:

    # "The sky outside is already dark."
    "外面的天空已经黑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7e9dd4cb:

    # e "Haskell, are you leaving already?"
    e "哈斯凯尔，你这么快就要走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f3aab09c:

    # h "I am."
    h "是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_249c7a3d:

    # e "But the party is not over yet."
    e "可派对还没结束。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_48646f05:

    # h "I'm getting old. I need to head back."
    h "我年纪大了，得回去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_d7241ae6:

    # "You look at the dragon and ask with concern."
    "你担忧地看着这条龙，开口问道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_50ffbefe:

    # e "Is the party not to your liking? Is that why you're leaving?"
    e "是派对不合你的心意吗？所以你才要走？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ea088135:

    # "Haskell takes his time to answer, making you nervous."
    "哈斯凯尔花了些时间才回答，让你有些紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ca4350fc:

    # h "Honestly, I had to think about that. It would have been easier to say yes, but you deserve some honesty, young courier."
    h "老实说，我得想一想。直接说“是”当然更容易，但你值得听到实话，小快递员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0588925d:

    # "You notice he has taken more time to think about his words."
    "你注意到他又花了些时间斟酌措辞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_83e0ce3e:

    # h "I was being frank when I said that I was getting older."
    h "我说自己年纪大了，并不是在开玩笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_74f973de:

    # e "Haskell, you're not that old."
    e "哈斯凯尔，你没那么老。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_84ab1cb7:

    # h "Correct. In dragon years, I'm in my prime. But compared to others, it's hard not to feel ancient."
    h "没错。按龙族的年龄算，我正值壮年。但和其他人相比，很难不觉得自己已经老古董了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_0b3e4dc9:

    # e "You feel very young to me."
    e "在我看来，你还年轻得很。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_c1fd6225:

    # "Haskell laughs."
    "哈斯凯尔笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2a1804d5:

    # h "Young courier, you know just what to say to tickle an aged dragon."
    h "年轻的快递员，你真知道该说什么，才能逗笑一条上了年纪的龙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_55cd195d:

    # h "Perhaps that's why I've been doing things that I never thought I would."
    h "也许这就是我开始做那些从未想过会做的事的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_9e15db04:

    # e "What do you mean?"
    e "你是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_64450ee0:

    # h "If you must know, I took my first special request for the first time in years."
    h "如果你非要知道，我接下了多年来的第一份特殊委托。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_2e9d2bd1:

    # h "Granted, it was as troublesome as I thought it would be, but it was quite fulfilling too."
    h "虽然它和我想的一样麻烦，但也相当令人满足。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_7ef040a2:

    # e "Haskell, you shouldn't have."
    e "哈斯凯尔，你不该这么做的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ce28f24b:

    # h "You're right. I shouldn't have but I did."
    h "你说得对。我本来不该做，但我还是做了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4cedc5af:

    # h "But the overall experience was not bad. It's quite fun helping a young blood establish his new adventure. And this young blood shows a lot of promise too."
    h "不过总体来说，体验并不差。帮助一个年轻人开启新的冒险相当有趣，而这个年轻人也很有潜力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_4acec7f1:

    # "You blush from the compliment. You feel proud. You know Haskell's compliments are not easy to come by."
    "你因为这番夸奖脸红了，心里感到自豪。你知道哈斯凯尔可不是轻易会夸人的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_833f23f1:

    # h "I don't mind taking a backseat to an up and coming adventurer."
    h "我不介意暂时退居幕后，让位给崭露头角的冒险者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_90a84a96:

    # h "My adventuring days are behind me but it doesn't mean I can't help another adventurer. So, thanks for showing me that."
    h "我的冒险生涯已经过去了，但这不代表我不能帮助另一位冒险者。所以，谢谢你让我明白这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ba8488df:

    # h "You've gotten me more active than ever. Ole will be very appreciative of you. He's always been bugging me to stop being so slovenly."
    h "你让我比以往都更积极了。奥利一定会很感激你。他总是催我别再这么懒散。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8054767a:

    # e "Haskell, thank you for helping me. Perhaps one day we can go on an adventure together."
    e "哈斯凯尔，谢谢你帮助我。也许有一天我们可以一起冒险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8e3961c0:

    # h "Be careful what you wish for young dragon. Once you get this dragon's blood pumping, there's no quenching it."
    h "年轻的龙啊，小心你许下的愿望。一旦让这条龙的血液沸腾起来，可就没那么容易平息了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_a735fc1d:

    # "Haskell takes in your whole body. You feel a mixture of anticipation and fear."
    "哈斯凯尔打量着你的全身。你感到既期待又害怕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_f13f8368:

    # e "Maybe I'm up for the challenge."
    e "也许我愿意接受挑战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_dbb1056c:

    # "Haskell raises his brow in surprise and then chuckles with mirth."
    "哈斯凯尔惊讶地挑了挑眉，随后愉快地笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_01b24c10:

    # h "Maybe, maybe. Young adventurer, I wonder where your future will take you. In any case, I see great things for you."
    h "也许吧，也许。年轻的冒险者，我真想知道你的未来会把你带向何方。不管怎样，我看好你的前途。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_96f78d55:

    # h "But that's for the future. For now, this old dragon has to retire to his hut, for he has an appointment with pots of tea at home."
    h "不过那是以后的事了。现在，这条老龙得回小屋养老，毕竟家里还有几壶茶在等着我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_58d3ed9d:

    # "Haskell leaves in the direction of the forest."
    "哈斯凯尔朝森林方向离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_ab677297:

    # "Soon, the party is winding down towards its end. Everyone begins dispersing to different corners of the tavern."
    "很快，派对渐渐接近尾声。大家开始散到酒馆的各个角落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_c3ddc133:

    # "And Haskell is already gone from the party."
    "哈斯凯尔已经离开派对了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_5f13be1b:

    # "You decide to spend one-on-one time with your friends before the day ends."
    "你决定在这一天结束前，分别和朋友们单独待一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_8e32d8d4:

    # "It seems... you have enough time to greet two of your friends."
    "看来……你还有时间去和两位朋友打招呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_3df318fc:

    # "The party is about to end. You decide to spend the last of it with one of them."
    "派对就要结束了。你决定和其中一人共度最后这段时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_69bb4449:

    # "You wander out the backdoor of the tavern."
    "你从酒馆的后门走了出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_112e4364:

    # "Jog is sitting on the stoop of the stairs with his back to you."
    "乔格背对着你，坐在台阶的门廊上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_6d297326:

    # "He's juggling a few pebbles with one hand."
    "他正用一只手抛接几颗小石子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_d2bd8a1e:

    # "He looks troubled."
    "他看起来很烦恼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_221b36c2:

    # "Just as you think about turning back, you hear his voice tentatively call out to you."
    "你正想着转身离开，忽然听到他试探着叫你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_d95b6315:

    # j "Since you're already here, why don't you join me and enjoy the night air?"
    j "既然你已经来了，为什么不坐过来和我一起享受夜晚的空气？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_7a846f39:

    # "You think about it and slowly ease down to sit beside Jog."
    "你想了想，慢慢坐到乔格身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_e25480f6:

    # e "How did you know I was there?"
    e "你怎么知道我在那里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_61115739:

    # "Jog gives you a skeptical look, clearly telling you that you should know why."
    "乔格狐疑地看了你一眼，显然是在告诉你答案不言自明。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_36ab54f6:

    # e "Right. Scout."
    e "对。斥候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_ef0a4c97:

    # j "Not just that. I also know you were listening in on the conversation between Ole and me."
    j "不只是因为那个。我还知道你偷听了我和奥利的谈话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_cdbff688:

    # e "I'm sorry."
    e "对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_25004cb1:

    # j "Don't need to be. I'm not ashamed of what happened."
    j "不用。我不为发生的事感到羞耻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_23a873e0:

    # j "I didn't do anything anyway."
    j "反正我什么也没做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_c8132bdc:

    # "Jog pauses as if waiting for you to counter him. When you don't, he looks at you with some surprise."
    "乔格停了下来，仿佛在等你反驳。见你没有回应，他有些惊讶地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_3fa0b813:

    # j "Aren't you going to follow your friends, and condemn me too?"
    j "你不打算跟着你的朋友们一起，也来指责我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_b35463cf:

    # e "You know, you're my friend too, Jog."
    e "你知道的，乔格，你也是我的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_56398d80:

    # e "But no, I'd rather reserve judgement until I hear the full story."
    e "不过，在听完事情的全部经过前，我还是不想妄下结论。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_070d6661:

    # "Jog chuckles mirthlessly."
    "乔格干笑了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_112bd4af:

    # j "A stupid decision, but fine. I'll tell you the story for giving me the benefit of the doubt."
    j "这决定真蠢，不过算了。既然你愿意相信我，我就把故事告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_7b2d5a3c:

    # e "I'm all ears."
    e "我洗耳恭听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_3d76d5d6:

    # j "Before you moved in, I was actually Seb's roommate."
    j "在你搬来之前，我其实是塞布的室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_e0201d98:

    # j "Shocking, right?"
    j "很震惊吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_b854f093:

    # j "But I was closer to Ole than Seb. It was Ole who arranged everything. The guy is too kind for his own good, but I was thankful to have a roof over my head."
    j "但我比塞布更接近奥利,是奥利安排了一切,他太客气了,不适合他,但我很感激有屋顶盖住我的头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_75d5626d:

    # e "Then, what happened?"
    e "然后发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_545c6166:

    # j "Jumping straight to the good stuff, are we?"
    j "你这是要直接跳到精彩部分吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_f498aaf4:

    # j "One day, merchandise in the shop disappeared. Ole and Seb wouldn't steal from themselves so I had to be the culprit."
    j "有一天，店里的货物不见了。奥利和塞布不可能偷自己的东西，所以我就成了那个嫌疑人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_22b077e9:

    # e "That's a rather quick conclusion."
    e "这结论下得也太快了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_4a7e1eaa:

    # "Jog shrugs."
    "乔格耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_138d4960:

    # j "Eh. My reputation wasn't exactly sparkling clean back then. So, Seb threw me out. Ole did try to help, but he didn't seem that convinced either. I guess I know why now. He doubts me too."
    j "呃，我那时的名声可算不上清白。所以塞布把我赶了出去。奥利确实试过帮忙，但他似乎也没那么相信我。我想我现在知道原因了。他也怀疑我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_57a7899e:

    # j "But it worked out for the best."
    j "但结果反而是最好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_9e15db04:

    # e "What do you mean?"
    e "你是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_98a34fad:

    # j "Got rid of those losers and found better company in Boss and Amble."
    j "摆脱了那些失败者 在老板和安布找到了更好的公司。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_d69d5688:

    # j "So things worked out."
    j "所以事情就这样解决了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_4170c552:

    # j "Plus, now I have you too. You're much better company than those two."
    j "而且现在我还有你。和你作伴可比和那两个家伙在一起舒服多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_1885d871:

    # "Jog slips his hand up your inner thigh. He uses the back of his hand to nudge your bulge."
    "乔格把手伸到你大腿内侧，用手背轻轻蹭了蹭你凸起的部位。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_da752769:

    # "You shiver. Despite everything, you feel like you understand Jog a bit better now."
    "你打了个寒颤。尽管发生了这些事，你觉得自己现在更理解乔格了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_574e8400:

    # "Could Jog's cheeky persona be his defense mechanism?"
    "乔格那副轻佻的样子，会不会其实是他的自我保护机制？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_ec07962f:

    # "You wonder."
    "你不禁思索。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_05f3db43:

    # e "I don't know what really happened, but do I trust that you wouldn't maliciously harm your friends. I can see that from how you interact with Lothar and Amble."
    e "我不知道事情究竟是怎么回事，但我相信你不会恶意伤害自己的朋友。从你和洛萨尔、安布相处的方式就能看出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_0727dcad:

    # "Jog's wandering hand pauses."
    "乔格游移的手停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_9439a2ad:

    # j "You're a strange guy, but I appreciate it."
    j "你这人真奇怪，不过我喜欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_90132799:

    # "Jog smacks your inner thigh and stands up."
    "乔格拍了拍你的大腿内侧，站起身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Jog_af0f2d01:

    # j "Anyway, I better go find Amble before the blockhead does anything stupid again."
    j "总之,我最好在那个白痴再做蠢事之前 去找安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_de35eb89:

    # "You find Cane packing stuff in the storeroom."
    "你发现凯恩正在储藏室里收拾东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_7ea37fc3:

    # "You step into it to join him."
    "你走进去，和他一起收拾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_387c4a39:

    # "Cane turns around to accost you."
    "凯恩转身来要你付出代价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_f0f1014d:

    # c "I hope ya enjoyed the party, lad, because there's gonna be a lot of cleaning to do tomorrow."
    c "希望你玩得开心，小伙子，因为明天有很多东西要打扫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_1ea85c53:

    # c "I rather regret lettin' Ole rent this place out for the day."
    c "我真有点后悔让奥利把这里租下来办一天的派对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_b9fcad41:

    # c "I mean, who'd a thought a few people'd be messier than a normal day at the tavern?"
    c "谁能想到，就这么几个人弄得比酒馆平时还乱？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_70959534:

    # c "Your friends could put right bandits to shame when it comes to partyin'."
    c "说到办派对，你的朋友们连强盗都要自愧不如。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_b60b787c:

    # e "'s a sure sign that everyone's havin' themselves good time."
    e "这就说明大家都玩得很开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_9cb3748b:

    # "Cane looks at you with a raised eyebrow, before promptly smacking you on the ass."
    "凯恩用眉毛看着你 然后再马上揍你屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_711f1159:

    # c "Tryin' ta imitate my accent now lad?"
    c "现在还学起我的口音来了，小伙子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_0376a308:

    # c "I appreciate the sentiment, 'specially since it's such a cute lad who's tryin' ta be like this old bat."
    c "我很欣赏你的心意，尤其是模仿我的还是你这么可爱的小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_ba9e5178:

    # "You hear his accent disappear for a second, like it did with Rahim, as he speaks quietly."
    "你听到他的口音消失了一秒钟 就像雷希姆那样 他说话很安静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_e8f88048:

    # c "...But you should pick better people to take after."
    c "……不过你应该找些更值得效仿的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_30ebdbbf:

    # "Before you can say anything about what happened, Cane ruffles your head and continues packing up."
    "在你对发生的事说之前 凯恩先把你的头打一巴掌 然后继续收拾东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_64f06f2d:

    # c "Well, I don't exactly see that lot volunteering to help clean up here."
    c "我可没见那帮人主动留下来帮忙收拾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_c8ceba7a:

    # "Cane lets out a hearty chuckle"
    "凯恩放出一个心跳的笑声"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_00f0b214:

    # c "Can't blame 'em, if it weren't my tavern I would a stuck to partying myself!"
    c "也不能怪他们，要不是这是我的酒馆，我自己也会只顾着参加派对！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_c4d86ac6:

    # e "I'll be here to help instead."
    e "那我留下来帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_c78a3449:

    # c "Good lad. If yer plannin' ta help, lend me a hand with these boxes."
    c "好小伙子。既然你打算帮忙，就搭把手搬搬这些箱子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_9a4b1d85:

    # c "Lothar's gang cleaned me out of most of my liquor stock. I've gotta prepare more for tomorrow."
    c "洛萨尔的帮会把我从酒库里洗干净了 我得为明天准备更多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_74964a79:

    # "You move to help. As you move the boxes, you continue the conversation."
    "你过去帮忙。搬箱子时，你们继续聊了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_b9b5c066:

    # e "Rahim is here today. Perhaps you can pay his store a visit in the future."
    e "雷希姆今天在这里 或许你将来可以去他的店里参观一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_7e4d44f8:

    # "Cane stops moving and narrows his eyes at you."
    "凯恩停下动作，眯眼看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_ccfc5974:

    # c "Whatcha up to?"
    c "你在忙什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_8b574544:

    # e "Just trying to help the reconciliation."
    e "只是想帮你们和好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_22a4a268:

    # c "Don't ya worry yer fuzzy little head about that. I only need ya ta look pretty."
    c "别用你那毛茸茸的小脑袋操心这个。我只需要你负责漂亮就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_836cbbb4:

    # "Cane continues to move another box."
    "凯恩继续移动另一个盒子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_0a4edbb9:

    # c "But thank you."
    c "不过，还是谢谢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_f55756ac:

    # "Cane pauses for a long time. Just as he is about to blow you off like usual, he sighs."
    "凯恩停了很久。正当他要像往常一样把你打发走时，他叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_4af327ac:

    # c "It's about that lad we talked about. His name's Topu."
    c "是关于我们刚才聊到的那个小伙子。他叫托普。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_4df3b39c:

    # c "He was one of the most finest lad I've met."
    c "他是我见过最出色的小伙子之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_d6598591:

    # c "But that brat was a real thrill-seeker. Always taking the most dangerous jobs, making away with m' darn mead."
    c "但那小鬼确实爱寻刺激。总是接最危险的活儿，还顺手拿走我的麦酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_5802764b:

    # "Cane turns to look at you."
    "凯恩转身看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_ddd4455e:

    # c "Rather like ya. But I'd rather he's out there adventuring like ya do. Instead of doin' whatever it is 'e does."
    c "这点倒是挺像你。不过，我宁愿他像你一样在外面冒险，也不想他去做那些……不知所谓的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_013c9b84:

    # c "The brat saw big things for himself. Nothin' wrong with that. But he was always lookin' for shortcuts, y'know?"
    c "那小鬼对自己的未来有远大的志向。这没什么不好。但他总想着走捷径，懂吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_a3653631:

    # c "Maybe one day, you'll wake up and see yerself as too big for this small little village too."
    c "也许有一天，你也会醒悟，觉得自己不该再待在这个小村子里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_6a7061e6:

    # e "That won't happen."
    e "不会发生那种事的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_0f051003:

    # "Cane smiles indulgently at you."
    "凯恩对你放纵地微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_26167052:

    # c "I can bet that yer wrong. Yer meant for greater things. Even this old drunk can see that."
    c "我敢打赌你错了。你注定要成就更大的事业。连我这个老醉鬼都看得出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_9cb50d95:

    # e "But I don't even know any place beyond the proximity of Lusterfield."
    e "但我甚至不知道 离乐斯民菲尔德很近的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_2a848081:

    # "Cane looks at you deeply like he can see into your future. Then, he grins."
    "凯恩看着你,就像他能看见你的未来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_61badab9:

    # c "Kid, just remember that we're not here to bog ya down. When ya get overwhelmed out there, remember that ya have friends at Lusterfield."
    c "孩子,记住我们不是来给你灌醉的 当你被挤得喘不过气来的时候,记住你在乐斯民菲尔德有朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_967975e5:

    # c "Even this old bat is always ready to give ya some physical comfort."
    c "就连我这个老家伙，也随时愿意给你一些身体上的安慰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_28c18cb4:

    # "Cane's idea of physical comfort is rather unconventional but you appreciate the thought."
    "凯恩对身体舒适的想法 相当不寻常 但你欣赏这个想法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_24f6be09:

    # e "Thanks, Cane."
    e "谢谢,凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_6478fd29:

    # c "Any day."
    c "随时都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_e5c33e2d:

    # c "Either way, Rahim was there when Topu asked me for money. Saw me reject the brat too."
    c "不管怎么说,当托普向我索要钱时,雷希姆也在场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_f280f22b:

    # c "Guess he must have put 2 and 2 together..."
    c "我想他是把这些线索联系起来了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_b9f58588:

    # e "Oh... But you're not really at fault."
    e "哦……但这也不能怪你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_616fd70c:

    # "Cane shakes his head."
    "凯恩摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_49cbb340:

    # c "No. I shoulda kept a closer eye on the brat."
    c "不。我本该更仔细地看着那小鬼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_9bbf2aa1:

    # c "Every day I wonder what life'd be like if things could've changed for the better..."
    c "我每天都在想，如果事情能变得更好，生活会是什么样……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_ee2e64b2:

    # e "Cane..."
    e "凯恩..."

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_d749bfac:

    # "Cane exhales as he moves another box."
    "当他移动另一个盒子时 凯恩会呼气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_fc7e4deb:

    # c "But that's in the past now."
    c "但那已经是过去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_059ce465:

    # c "Now my eye's on ya. I made a promise to rahim... and to myself."
    c "现在我的眼睛盯着你,我向雷希姆..."

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_90ea445f:

    # "You feel quite touched when you felt... touched."
    "你感到一阵感动，因为你确实……被触碰到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_1b3da84e:

    # "Cane's hand runs along your thigh, ruffling your fur as he goes."
    "凯恩的手沿着你的大腿滑过，一路揉乱你的毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_e0b844e4:

    # c "After all, it's hard to train another server."
    c "毕竟，再培训一个侍者可不容易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_af80f27d:

    # c "'Specially one who has a nice bod like yours."
    c "尤其是身材像你这么好的侍者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_6e157353:

    # "He says this while pulling your body close to his."
    "他说着，把你的身体拉近自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_b6b52d4f:

    # "You feel the bat's rough fur press against the soft fur of your back, as well as a warm bump pressing greedily against your rump."
    "你感觉这只蝙蝠粗糙的毛压上你柔软的背部，同时还有一处温热的凸起贪婪地顶着你的臀部。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_8b8d2de2:

    # "Just as quickly as it started, the bat ends the embrace, giving your butt a light squeeze and a slap as he pulls away."
    "拥抱开始得快，结束得也快。他松开你时轻轻捏了捏你的屁股，又拍了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Cane_c5b46a0c:

    # c "Now get back out there and enjoy yerself, lad. Everyone's 'ere to celebrate ya, and ya deserve the break."
    c "现在回去好好享受吧，小伙子。大家都是来庆祝你的，而你也值得休息一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_4edcddd1:

    # "You find Lothar standing outside in the garden."
    "你发现洛萨尔站在花园外面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_c1521b17:

    # "The grass crunches under your feet as you walks towards him."
    "你朝他走去，脚下的草发出沙沙声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_9d3f470f:

    # l "Disciple, what you doing out here?"
    l "弟子，你在这里做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_46742b7d:

    # e "Lot, are you alright?"
    e "洛萨尔，你还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_156224e8:

    # l "Why wouldn't I be? I'm the Hero of Lusterfield. And call me Lothar."
    l "我是乐斯民菲尔德的英雄,叫我洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_4d19ad57:

    # e "The confrontation earlier was rather intense. Do you want to talk about it?"
    e "刚才的冲突挺激烈的。你想聊聊吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_0850dd89:

    # l "Heroes talk with actions and not words."
    l "英雄用行动说话，而不是用言语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_36bbbc23:

    # e "Okay. Then, I'll just stand out here and enjoy the night sky with you."
    e "好吧。那我就站在这里，陪你一起欣赏夜空。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_53288926:

    # l "Whatever."
    l "随便。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_b5a41306:

    # "You stand there comfortably, feeling the wind on your skin."
    "你自在地站在那里，感受着拂过皮肤的微风。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_ee442f3c:

    # "after a while, Lothar coughs."
    "过了一会儿,洛萨尔咳嗽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_58fd7f1f:

    # l "Disciple, do you think I'm good company?"
    l "弟子，你觉得我算是个好伙伴吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_c36e2806:

    # e "Why would you ask that, Lot?"
    e "你为什么这么问，洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_a83d658a:

    # l "You didn't answer the question, Disciple."
    l "你还没回答问题，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_baa9de25:

    # e "Well. I don't mind hanging out with you, Lot."
    e "嗯。我不介意和你待在一起，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_34698556:

    # "Lothar is quiet for a while."
    "洛萨尔沉默了一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_185f2795:

    # l "Of course, you wouldn't, Disciple. I'm the Hero of Lusterfield. It's your honor to spend time with me."
    l "当然,你不会的,朋友,我是乐斯民菲尔德的英雄 和我一起度过时光是你的荣幸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_1d6ed170:

    # l "But... Rest of Lusterfield may not feel that way."
    l "但乐斯民菲尔德的其他地方可能没有这种感觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_6fa10c87:

    # e "What do you mean, Lot?"
    e "你是什么意思，洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_d4e43972:

    # l "I sense little patience in others. And the lion is right about one thing."
    l "我能感觉到别人对我没什么耐心。而那头狮子有一点说得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_d686c4b2:

    # l "I don't get invited to these friendly social events often unless it's from Jog or Amble. But what do they have going on?"
    l "除非是乔格或安布邀请我参加这些友好的社会活动？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_893b5693:

    # e "I'm glad you're here at the party."
    e "我很高兴你来参加派对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_174fbabb:

    # l "Of course you are, disciple. Who wouldn't want the Hero at their functions?"
    l "当然，弟子。谁不想让英雄参加自己的聚会？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_ef6d793a:

    # "Technically, Lothar has already answered that question himself. But you don't say anything lest you hit a sore spot."
    "严格来说,洛萨尔自己已经回答了这个问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_68e2a908:

    # l "Why?"
    l "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_d5de1ced:

    # "It's a simple word but you understand the meaning behind it."
    "这只是一个简单的词，但你明白它背后的含义。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_c427a369:

    # e "Perhaps it's because you're the Hero of Lusterfield."
    e "也许是因为你是乐斯民菲尔德的英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_4564e27a:

    # l "Yes, I am."
    l "是的，我是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_b0bee940:

    # e "But you are more than that Lot."
    e "但你不只是英雄，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_60d56f34:

    # "Lothar looks at you with incomprehension."
    "洛萨尔对你一目了然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_1db16df7:

    # e "People might appreciate getting to know Lothar than the Hero of Lusterfield."
    e "人们可能比乐斯民菲尔德的英雄 更喜欢了解洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_5c2e7874:

    # l "But that's who I am."
    l "但我就是这样的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_a821dfd4:

    # e "Lot, you are more than that. I've seen it before."
    e "洛萨尔，你比那更多。我以前见过这样的你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_6996960a:

    # e "Remember when you carried me back after I lost to you?"
    e "还记得你输给我之后，是我把你背回来的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_b5b3ccfe:

    # l "You mean when the Hero crushed you and you could barely walk anymore?"
    l "你是说英雄把你彻底击溃、让你几乎走不了路的那次？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_aaacbfb1:

    # e "Yes. You carried me back to the shop and cared for me. That shows Lothar's kindness under the name of the Hero."
    e "是的,你把我带回店里照顾我,这显示了洛萨尔以英雄之名的仁慈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_76711565:

    # l "Yea. Well. A Hero has to take care of everyone here."
    l "没错。英雄就该照顾这里的每个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_cf7f55e2:

    # e "Remember when we had that battle and I bested you?"
    e "还记得我们那次交手，是我赢了你吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_a6490917:

    # l "You were lucky Disciple. That won't happen again."
    l "你只是走运了，弟子。不会再有下一次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_5d39f978:

    # e "Regardless, you chose to honor the terms of our bet."
    e "不管怎样，你还是选择遵守了赌约。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_a5ebc800:

    # l "That's cause I have faith in the integrity of my Disciple."
    l "因为我相信我的弟子是个守信的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_60ebced8:

    # e "Are you sure?"
    e "你确定？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_daac137e:

    # l "Of course, you're my Disciple!"
    l "当然，你可是我的弟子！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_ef4fdfa3:

    # e "Either way, you're ready to honor the terms and that shows Lothar's humility under the Hero's veneer."
    e "无论哪种方式,你都准备遵守条件 并且这显示了洛萨尔在英雄的名下谦卑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_9926bae6:

    # l "A hero never go back on his words after all."
    l "毕竟英雄从不会食言。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_3cb35f33:

    # "Lothar's face blushes at the memory."
    "洛萨尔的脸在记忆中脸红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_501f295f:

    # l "You won somehow, so a Hero has to honor his words."
    l "你不知怎么赢了，所以英雄必须信守承诺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_1c9a7725:

    # e "That day, I got to see another side of the Hero that not many has seen before."
    e "那天，我看到了英雄不为人知的一面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_184cbf29:

    # l "...Like I said, you squeezed too hard last time."
    l "……就像我说的，你上次下手太重了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_3d153c67:

    # l "I'll never promise that again... if we happen to fight."
    l "如果我们再交手……我再也不会答应那种事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_a03c171a:

    # e "uhh..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_010414b5:

    # e "In conclusion, Lothar, you are more than just the Hero of Lusterfield."
    e "最后,洛萨尔,你不仅仅是乐斯民菲尔德的英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_f8d27d51:

    # e "Jog, Amble and I know that."
    e "乔格、安布和我知道这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_84d37cf1:

    # e "Maybe you should let others see it too."
    e "也许你也该让别人看到这一面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_9da84c5d:

    # "Lothar is expressionless for a long time. Then, he whips his head from left to right."
    "洛萨尔很久没有表情了 然后他从左向右抽头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_12bab6f2:

    # l "Doesn't make sense to me. What can a Disciple teach the Hero of Lusterfield anyway?"
    l "我不明白这有什么意义。弟子还能教乐斯民菲尔德的英雄什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_e09e3958:

    # l "I-... I'm going back in to take advantage of the free drinks before the party's over."
    l "我、我先回去了，趁派对结束前再喝点免费的饮料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Lothar_211aabf3:

    # "Lothar saunters away. You notice the usual spring is back in the Hero's steps."
    "洛萨尔的守夜者离开 你注意到平常的春天又回到了英雄的脚步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_1da6b3b0:

    # "You see Seb pacing around the tavern corridor."
    "你看到塞布在酒馆走廊里来回踱步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_42dd5a61:

    # "When he sees you, he doesn't greet you as enthusiastically as he normally would."
    "他看到你时，没有像平常那样热情地打招呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_713403ac:

    # e "Seb, what's wrong?"
    e "塞布，怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_92d4b731:

    # s "Roomie, I'm sorry."
    s "室友，对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_0f829ce4:

    # e "What for?"
    e "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_947b39db:

    # s "For ruining your party. This is supposed to be fun but I had to get into an argument with that stupid wolf."
    s "把你的派对搞砸了。本来应该开心的，可我却和那头蠢狼吵了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_00faa332:

    # s "I've calmed down after talking to Ole and realized how it must have affected your party. So I'm sorry."
    s "我和奥利谈过后冷静下来 意识到这一定影响了你的派对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_47bc3ed7:

    # e "Seb, I don't mind."
    e "塞布，我不介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_d6c8068e:

    # "Sebas cracks a small smile."
    "塞巴斯露出一丝浅笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_c58d49dc:

    # s "Roomy, you don't know how happy I am to hear that, but I'm still sorry."
    s "室友，听你这么说我真的很开心，但我还是很抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_3ba8ec69:

    # e "Stop apologizing. By the way, why did you get into the argument with Lothar?"
    e "别再道歉了。对了，你为什么要和洛萨尔吵架？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_7e1752e7:

    # "Sebas groans with annoyance."
    "塞巴斯烦躁地呻吟了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_3f9a73a0:

    # s "I didn't even wanted to invite the stupid wolf, but Ole said that the wolf has been featured in your life at Lusterfield too."
    s "我什至不想邀请 愚蠢的狼,但奥利说,狼 已经被特写 在你的生活中 在乐斯民菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_b4c845f7:

    # s "You know how insistent Ole can be on pleasing everyone."
    s "你知道奥利有多坚持 让大家高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_4f62210e:

    # e "I do know that."
    e "这点我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_e21023d9:

    # s "And... you saw what happened."
    s "而且……你也看到了发生的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_f810f16b:

    # "Sebas pouts."
    "塞巴斯撅起了嘴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_6c4b44b3:

    # e "Seb, why didn't you want Lothar to come anyway?"
    e "塞伯,你为什么不让洛萨尔来呢?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_2f94a671:

    # s "It's you, Roomy."
    s "是因为你，室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_ce0a52eb:

    # e "Me?"
    e "我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_bd984a7e:

    # s "Yea. You've been spending too much time with the wolf."
    s "你最近和那头狼待在一起的时间太多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_c66842c8:

    # "You raise your brows."
    "你挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_bbff52be:

    # e "Are you jealous, Seb?"
    e "塞布，你吃醋了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_8fe21f33:

    # "Seb smacks you jokingly."
    "塞布开玩笑似的拍了你一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_53ad945a:

    # s "Roomie, what if I say that I am?"
    s "室友，如果我说是呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_7273b5ab:

    # s "But that's not the real reason."
    s "但那不是真正的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_673763eb:

    # e "Aw, I was hoping that was the real reason. But what is it?"
    e "啊，我还希望那就是真正的原因呢。不过到底是为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_3156e8fe:

    # s "The wolf mixes with the wrong kind of crowd."
    s "那头狼混进了不该混的圈子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_068e12d6:

    # s "Amble is better, but the other..."
    s "安布更好,但另一个..."

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_bd6f10ab:

    # s "His team is nothing more than a ragtag group of gangsters."
    s "他那伙人不过是一群乌合之众的匪徒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_44c513b9:

    # e "Perhaps after you know them..."
    e "也许等你了解他们之后……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_d2ffd36f:

    # s "I know them well enough."
    s "我已经够了解他们了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_ac44acfc:

    # s "I just don't want them to have a bad influence on you."
    s "我只是不希望他们给你带来坏影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_4ed35ac1:

    # s "You're supposed to be my good Roomy, not off forming gangs with the stupid wolf."
    s "你应该是我的好室友，而不是跟那头蠢狼结成帮派到处鬼混。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_04a880fd:

    # e "You worry too much, Seb. Nothing like that is happening."
    e "你想太多了，塞布。根本没有那回事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_8501b5e1:

    # s "Am I? You didn't even side with me when I could have gotten my revenge on the wolf with a kick back to his nuts."
    s "是吗？那次我本来可以踢那头狼的蛋报仇，你却连站我这边都不肯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_a7ddffbf:

    # e "How is that the same thing? I just don't want to see any other nuts casualty."
    e "这怎么能相提并论？我只是不想再出现其他蛋蛋受害者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_0253eeee:

    # s "But what about my nuts?"
    s "那我的蛋蛋呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_7666eac0:

    # e "What about them?"
    e "它们怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_5443dac7:

    # "You smirk."
    "你坏笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_4b7ea74e:

    # s "Very slick, buddy."
    s "真会说，伙计。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_bf42394a:

    # e "Clearly, that's not happening. Haven't I helped you take revenge by allowing you to kick Lothar's back?"
    e "显然不是。我不是还帮你踢了洛萨尔的屁股，让你报仇了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_c6f709f0:

    # e "Would I do that if I'm in some sort of gang with them?"
    e "如果我真和他们一伙，我会这么做吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_16aba927:

    # "Sebas taps his chin."
    "塞巴斯敲了敲下巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_5b6a6b95:

    # s "Guess you're right..."
    s "我猜你说得对……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_1d0563be:

    # s "But still, I can't help but worry. I've seen the same thing happen with Ole."
    s "不过我还是忍不住担心。我以前也见过奥利遇到同样的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_3ec5fc6b:

    # s "I'm not going to watch my Roomy fall into the clutches of the stupid Wolf."
    s "我不会眼睁睁看着我的室友落入那头蠢狼的魔爪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_b6df00bf:

    # e "Seb, I appreciate the concern. But by your same logic, if they can influence me, I'd be influenced by you and Ole too."
    e "塞布,我很感激你的关心,但按照你的逻辑, 如果他们能影响我,我也会受到你和奥利的影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_9b072554:

    # e "Knowing that I have your care will make sure that I'll not stray from the right path."
    e "知道你关心我，我就不会偏离正道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_4b454ff5:

    # s "ROOMY, you're right! That's a great idea!"
    s "室友，你说得对！好主意！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_c032bcdf:

    # "Sebas runs into you and pulls you into a tight embrace."
    "塞巴斯朝你跑来，把你紧紧抱住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_eaf364db:

    # s "I'm going to infuse my influence into you so that you'd never be led astray by the stupid wolf."
    s "我要把我的影响力灌输给你，这样你就不会被那头蠢狼带偏了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_473ba8a1:

    # "Seb rubs his fur against yours. It's very ticklish."
    "塞布用他的毛蹭着你的毛，痒得你直想笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_4a6f890b:

    # "Suddenly, you feel a firm grab on your ass."
    "突然，你感觉有人用力抓住了你的屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_44cfe32c:

    # s "I might have other ways that I can lay influence into my fluffy roomie."
    s "我可能还有别的办法，把影响力留在我毛茸茸的室友身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_d5639004:

    # e "Seb, stop joking. We're in public."
    e "塞布，别开玩笑了。这里可是公共场合。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_60b3a95b:

    # s "Fine, fine. But we do need to find a more discreet place to resume what you started."
    s "好了好了。不过我们确实得找个隐蔽点的地方，继续你刚才开始的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_1624f82e:

    # s "Last time I almost got caught by a customer because of it."
    s "上次我差点因此被客人撞见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_cd97fd54:

    # "You scratch behind your ears shyly."
    "你害羞地挠了挠耳朵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_cac9067e:

    # e "Sorry."
    e "对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_04e41727:

    # s "Well, it was fun, isn't that what it's all about."
    s "不过那很有意思，不就是为了这个吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_a4f52a06:

    # e "You're being silly, Seb."
    e "你真调皮，塞布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Sebas_7375b797:

    # "Seb continues to hug you tight until Seb feels it is enough to fend out the wolf's influence."
    "塞布继续紧紧抱着你，直到他觉得已经足以抵挡那头狼的影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_73dba177:

    # "You spot Ole cleaning up after the others."
    "你看到奥利正在收拾其他人留下的残局。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_336e1ad8:

    # "You shake your head helplessly as you walk over to help."
    "你无奈地摇摇头，走过去帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_6c801a76:

    # o "[e], you don't need to do this. It's your party."
    o "[e]，你不用做这个。这是你的派对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_b860dcfa:

    # e "Ole, it's not like you need to do this either. We're not back at the shop."
    e "奥利,你也不该这么做,我们不在店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_89774832:

    # "Ole flushes from embarrassment."
    "奥利尴尬得红了脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_44f86d7b:

    # o "It's fine. I like helping out. Plus, we've made a mess. We better clean up before Cane gets mad."
    o "没关系,我喜欢帮忙,还有,我们弄得一团糟 最好在凯恩发疯之前收拾干净。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_e56d3c54:

    # e "Then, let me help you. At least I work here part time. I have more of a reason to help out than you do."
    e "那就让我帮你吧。至少我还在这里做兼职，比你更有理由帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_cb383071:

    # "As you move to clean up the empty mugs and plates, Ole sighs and obliges."
    "当你开始清理空杯子和盘子时 奥利叹气和义务。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_a89b2db3:

    # "After you two clean up a table, you grab Ole and stop him."
    "你们两个收拾桌子之后 抓住奥利阻止他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_b24a3b5b:

    # e "Ole, I think you deserve a rest."
    e "奥利，我觉得你该休息一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_aaceb945:

    # o "I'm fine..."
    o "我没事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_11fdc540:

    # "You interrupt him."
    "你打断了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_bcc3f2bc:

    # e "This is my party. At least, have fun."
    e "这是我的派对。至少，你也该玩得开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_323abb76:

    # "You smile at him."
    "你朝他笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_2a882fb6:

    # e "If you really need to find something to do, talk with me."
    e "如果你真的需要找点事做，就和我聊聊吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_e3c00514:

    # "Ole acquiesces."
    "奥利点头答应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_eecb5f37:

    # o "Alright. What is it that you want to talk about?"
    o "好吧。你想聊什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_0af36474:

    # e "Thank you."
    e "谢谢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_4cb915f4:

    # o "What for?"
    o "谢我什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_ddbbff26:

    # e "For this."
    e "为了这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_6b8bf2f2:

    # "You gesture at the party around you."
    "你指了指周围的派对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_d34e2ab4:

    # o "I didn't do anything. This is Seb's idea. You should thank him."
    o "我什么都没做。这是塞布的主意。你该谢谢他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_5ba0b046:

    # e "Don't undersell yourself. Like you said, Seb can't just come up with all the planning on his own. You've done a lot and I want to thank you for it."
    e "别把自己说得这么轻松。就像你说的，塞布不可能独自想出所有安排。你为此做了很多，我想谢谢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_bce79456:

    # o "It's no problem. I like to help."
    o "没什么。我喜欢帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_3a9f9274:

    # "You nudge him."
    "你轻轻碰了碰他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_d3b7c1f0:

    # e "Yes, but you have to take a breather too."
    e "没错，但你也得喘口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_15453245:

    # o "What do you mean?"
    o "你是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_2beb6c57:

    # e "We don't want the incident from last time to happen again, do we?"
    e "我们可不想上次那件事重演，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_c509f978:

    # "Ole lowers his head."
    "奥利低下头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_07abc845:

    # o "..."
    o "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_cdbf8240:

    # e "Brighten up, Ole. I don't mean to bring the mood down. I'm just saying that we need to help ourselves before we can help others."
    e "振作点，奥利。我不是想让气氛变得沉重，只是说我们得先帮助自己，才能帮助别人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_40828e90:

    # o "It's not that. I really appreciate the concern, but you're wrong."
    o "不是那个意思。我很感谢你的关心，但你说错了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_888eb8a6:

    # e "Oh?"
    e "哦？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_c9d0b4c1:

    # o "I mean I don't mind that incident happening again... especially the last part with you and me..."
    o "我的意思是，我不介意那件事再发生一次……尤其是最后你和我做的那部分……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_b93a5ea2:

    # "You swear Ole is about to burn from the embarrassment."
    "你发誓奥利要因尴尬而火上浇油了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_cffb2d2e:

    # "You grin."
    "你咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_61c7ddbd:

    # e "Ole, I have no idea you're so naughty."
    e "奥利，真没想到你这么调皮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_14d1e372:

    # o "N-no. It's not that. It's just I've been thinking about it since that day."
    o "不、不是那个意思。只是从那天起，我一直在想这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_c312c64c:

    # e "Honestly? Me too."
    e "说实话？我也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_eb36580e:

    # e "I wouldn't mind doing more with you."
    e "我不介意和你再进一步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_64a1e2b0:

    # "Ole blushes violently."
    "奥利的脸一下子涨得通红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_a8763211:

    # o "But I have no experience at all with these things..."
    o "但我对这些事完全没有经验……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_966c01a7:

    # "Then something comes to your mind and it's your turn to be embarrassed."
    "突然，你想起一件事，这次轮到你尴尬了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_afd7a843:

    # e "Ole... What about... you know... the thing you saw... with Seb and me... under the table."
    e "奥利……那你见过的……就是你看到塞布和我在桌子底下做的那件事……怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_e1d34ed5:

    # o "T-that's fine... I don't mind if you don't mind."
    o "这、这没关系……只要你不介意，我也不介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_80764434:

    # "You believe that's the limit with Ole because Ole stops talking and starts to furiously clean a spot on the table."
    "你觉得这已经是奥利能接受的极限了，因为他不再说话，开始疯狂擦拭桌上的某个地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_daf8147c:

    # e "Then, this the perfect chance for us to help each other. We'll explore and help each other!"
    e "那正是我们互相帮助的好机会。我们可以一起探索，互相帮助！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_47b41adc:

    # o "Hmm..."
    o "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_a948e38f:

    # o "Now I think, we shouldn't do this too often."
    o "现在想想，我们不该太频繁地做这种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_3178c698:

    # o "I don't want folks to see how... not me. I was."
    o "我不想让别人看到我……那副样子。我刚才就是那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_de35e021:

    # e "You do not enjoy it?"
    e "你不喜欢吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_6a7dca02:

    # o "I do."
    o "喜欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_04875a7c:

    # o "But, that wasn't who I am."
    o "但那不是我真正的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_39ca890d:

    # e "...Ole?"
    e "……奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_e52a0987:

    # o "Sorry, I'm not used to talk about myself this much."
    o "抱歉，我不习惯这么多地谈论自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_baa5bf52:

    # "The lizard ponders for a moment."
    "蜥蜴沉思了片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_0082da47:

    # "Ole grabs your hand, he is holding it tight. His nails dig deep into your palm."
    "奥利抓住你的手，紧紧握着。指甲深深陷入你的掌心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_f6cd493c:

    # o "Let's say. we can spend more time on doing other stuff together."
    o "这么说吧。我们可以多花些时间一起做点别的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_75d34912:

    # "You can feel his warmth soon spread across your body. You are stunned for a second."
    "你感觉他的温度很快传遍全身，一时愣住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_a6a4d4c0:

    # e "W-what do you mean."
    e "你、你什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_cbadc1eb:

    # "His thumb sweeps your palm lightly, before letting you go."
    "他的拇指轻轻划过你的掌心，然后松开了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_ea7ac80c:

    # "You feel Ole presses against your snout."
    "你感觉奥利贴上了你的口鼻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_b2fd5087:

    # o "I feel like you are getting excited for the wrong reason."
    o "我觉得你兴奋的理由不太对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Ole_d6888b15:

    # o "But... I'll sleep on it."
    o "但是……我会考虑一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_ba3b9bf4:

    # "You squeeze into the seat across from Rahim."
    "你挤到雷希姆对面的座位上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_a656bfd0:

    # "You notice that Rahim is a lot more relaxed than when you talked to him earlier."
    "你注意到雷希姆比之前和他谈话时 放松多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_28a78edf:

    # "Perhaps his talk with Cane has loosened many things within him... or perhaps it's the alcohol."
    "也许他和凯恩的谈话 放松了他的很多内涵... 或者可能是酒精。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_25215ba2:

    # e "Rahim, are you alright?"
    e "雷希姆,你没事吧?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_c9ce3f09:

    # r "Why wouldn't I be?"
    r "我为什么不高兴？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_6e74df11:

    # e "Well... I kinda overheard your conversation with Cane earlier."
    e "我之前听到你和凯恩的谈话了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_7bf3fe44:

    # "Rahim becomes silent. You fear that he might be angry for the eavesdropping."
    "雷希姆沉默了 你怕他为偷听而生气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_4ff5b962:

    # "After a while, Rahim heaves a large sigh and his body droops."
    "过了一段时间,雷希姆就大叹了口气, 身体也下垂了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_03bf9c39:

    # r "I guess we weren't trying to hide it. And this is a public place..."
    r "我想我们也没打算隐瞒。而且这里毕竟是公共场合……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_5cfd43b1:

    # "Rahim looks around as if seeing things there that you can't."
    "雷希姆环视四周 好像看到一些你无法看见的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_9ba838a1:

    # r "But you're right. Being here is rather strange. It's hard not to see the traces of Topu everywhere."
    r "但你说得对。待在这里确实很奇怪。很难不在每个角落都看到托普留下的痕迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_135cfae9:

    # e "Rahim, if you don't want to talk about this, I can..."
    e "雷希姆 如果你不想谈这个 我可以..."

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_8523b7ed:

    # "Rahim waves his hands."
    "雷希姆挥手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_60fd86c5:

    # r "I owe you this much."
    r "这是我欠你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_04aac496:

    # r "Cane and I have been talking you around this person that you've not even met. That's unfair to you."
    r "凯恩和我一直在和你谈论 你没见过的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_612515b4:

    # e "It's fine. I understand."
    e "没关系。我理解。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_9b317a7a:

    # r "... That's why you are so similar and yet so different from Topu."
    r "……所以你才会和托普如此相似，却又截然不同。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_9e15db04:

    # e "What do you mean?"
    e "你是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_6d784a85:

    # r "He would have stayed to listen too, but I'm not sure if he would have understood."
    r "他也会留下来听，但我不确定他能不能听懂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_508972f3:

    # r "The kid has never been much of a listener."
    r "那孩子从来就不太擅长倾听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_4debc7e3:

    # e "He must be special to have you and Cane cherish him that much."
    e "他一定很特别 才能有你和凯恩那么珍惜他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_7b18c076:

    # "Rahim takes another sip of the beer and a frown appears between his brows."
    "雷希姆又喝了一小口啤酒 眉眉之间又露出皱眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_2734b04c:

    # r "... He's not perfect."
    r "……他并不完美。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_9e15db04_1:

    # e "What do you mean?"
    e "你是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_4c6f908c:

    # r "If I have handed him the same quest to gather the feedback on the clothes, he would have figured out a way to get all three sets from me. And I would have let him."
    r "如果我把同样的任务交给他，让他收集对衣服的反馈，他肯定会想办法从我这里拿走三套衣服，而我也会由着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_b75831ca:

    # r "He just has this charm about him."
    r "他就是有那种魅力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_acdff7be:

    # r "But you've never considered doing that."
    r "但你从没想过要这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_bc4a7b11:

    # e "Thanks?"
    e "谢谢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_f53dc925:

    # r "Sadly, he has followed the wrong mentor."
    r "可惜，他跟错了导师。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_f0f8b6ef:

    # "Rahim glances up at the counter where Rahim is."
    "雷希姆在雷希姆所在的柜台看望着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_312d62cd:

    # "Instead of anger, there is an underlying layer of regret in Rahim's eyes."
    "雷希姆眼里没有愤怒,而是有一层深层的悔恨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_0b0788c8:

    # "Then, Rahim trains his eyes on you."
    "然后,雷希姆训练他的眼睛盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_e6522cfc:

    # r "Kid, if there's anything to learn here, it's that you have a wide support system."
    r "孩子，如果这里有什么值得你学的，那就是你拥有一个强大的支持系统。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_62301e45:

    # r "If you ever run into any trouble, come to me..."
    r "如果你遇到什么麻烦，就来找我……"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_de82695b:

    # "You are touched by Rahim's sincerity."
    "雷希姆的真诚感动了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_25fcab1c:

    # e "Rahim, thank you."
    e "雷希姆,谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Rahim_1b297bff:

    # "Rahim grunts and he reverts to his usual bullish self."
    "雷希姆的咕噜声和他 回到他平时的粗鲁自我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_63e355db:

    # "At the party, Amble immediately draws your attention."
    "在派对上,安布立即提请你注意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_33ea2c13:

    # "He appears to be juggling a handful of jugs with his massive arms."
    "他看起来正用粗壮的手臂抛接几只大酒壶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_c4dc9924:

    # "You walk over and offer to help."
    "你走过去，主动提出帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_dbeb2d0b:

    # e "Amble, what are you doing? And is there anything I can do to help? You look like you have your hands full."
    e "安布，你在做什么？有什么我能帮忙的吗？看起来你手头的事可不少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_b15269a3:

    # "Amble peeks over the jugs of beer and breaks into a smile when he sees you."
    "安布从一堆啤酒壶后探出头，看到你后咧嘴笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_7f9dec02:

    # a "Puny friend, it's you!"
    a "小不点朋友，是你！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_df58a5a5:

    # e "So, what are you doing?"
    e "那你在做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_1db1cab0:

    # a "I'm trying to juggle as many beer jugs as I can."
    a "我正努力同时抛接尽可能多的啤酒壶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_18676921:

    # "Amble shifts his weight as one of the jugs teeters dangerously."
    "安布挪了挪重心，其中一只酒壶危险地摇晃起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_3ad9893b:

    # a "Phew, that was close."
    a "呼，真险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_88f4fddc:

    # e "Erm... Amble... Why are you doing this?"
    e "安布 你为什么要这么做?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_2f178ac9:

    # a "Cause I am in on a bet!"
    a "因为我在打赌！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_692db217:

    # e "What bet?"
    e "赌什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_02e5b142:

    # a "A bet with cane! He bets that I can't juggle more than five jugs at the same time."
    a "和凯恩打赌！他赌我没法同时抛接超过五只酒壶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_3bdc4ae8:

    # a "I am always ready to prove him wrong!"
    a "我随时准备证明他错了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_8ab219d0:

    # "Plus, if I can hold them for more than 10 minutes, I get to drink them all!"
    "而且，如果我能坚持十分钟以上，就可以把它们全喝掉！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_35113757:

    # "If you had to take a guess, Cane is setting up a bet based on whether Amble can accomplish this feat or not."
    "如果你不得不猜测,凯恩正在根据安布能否完成这个成就 来打赌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_3b331fdf:

    # "From the looks of it, most are betting against Amble."
    "从表面看 多数人赌的是安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_f5c6c1a5:

    # e "No. I mean Cane is using you to start a bet of his own."
    e "不,我是说凯恩在利用你 自己下注。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_822820f6:

    # a "Oh. I know about that. I'm betting that I'd win too."
    a "哦，这个我知道。我也赌自己会赢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_1c3f94d0:

    # e "And Cane allowed that?"
    e "凯恩允许吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_aeadcb9b:

    # a "Why wouldn't he? Everything deserves a fair chance, right?"
    a "他为什么不赌？每件事都该有公平的机会，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_e60fe8a2:

    # "Technically, that is not right."
    "严格来说，不是这样的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_1bf36fe0:

    # "Cane knows that Amble has a stake in winning the bet for both the money and the drinks."
    "肯尼知道安布有赌注 为了钱和酒赌注。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_7e77c37c:

    # "So he must have persuaded the others to bet against Amble winning."
    "所以他一定说服了其他人 来打赌安布赢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_48c24dc2:

    # "However, since everyone is willing to play along, you decide you would too."
    "不过，既然大家都愿意配合，你决定自己也来凑个热闹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_2a7a3353:

    # e "Yea, you're right. I'll be supporting you then."
    e "对，你说得对。那我会支持你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_9f0aa659:

    # a "Thanks, puny friend!"
    a "谢谢你，小不点朋友！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_fffd6ba5:

    # a "Glad to know you're on my side!"
    a "很高兴你站在我这边！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_ea82b5bc:

    # "Minutes later, Amble waves you over."
    "几分钟后,安布向你挥手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_d65b1a9c:

    # a "Hey, puny friend. Come join me!"
    a "嘿，小不点朋友。过来和我一起玩！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_cd57d31e:

    # "The jugs of beer are spread on the table."
    "啤酒壶摊放在桌上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_e0e9f18f:

    # e "Looks like you've won."
    e "看来你赢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_e870fe79:

    # a "Sure did!"
    a "当然！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_64b961af:

    # "Amble pushes a jug of frothy beer to you."
    "安布把一壶冒着泡沫的啤酒推给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_87d19c7c:

    # a "And this is for you!"
    a "这个也是给你的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_2f35259e:

    # e "Me? Thanks. But why?"
    e "给我的？谢谢。但为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_caf190c4:

    # a "You were on my side and gave me support. This is the least I can offer you back!"
    a "你站在我这边支持我。这是我能回报你的最微薄之物！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_e1ea108e:

    # e "Thanks, Amble!"
    e "谢谢,安布!"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_b085d5b2:

    # a "Welcome, puny friend!"
    a "欢迎你，小不点朋友！"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_Amble_af51cac8:

    # "Amble bumps his beer against yours."
    "安布把他的啤酒撞到你的头上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_End_3784b222:

    # "The party eventually reaches its end."
    "派对最终迎来了结束。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_End_defa67b1:

    # "Your friends leaves the tavern one by one."
    "你的朋友们一个接一个离开酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_End_3cb7698c:

    # "You bid farewell to them at the door."
    "你在门口向他们道别。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_End_3f9dd3fe:

    # "Cane closes the door behind you."
    "凯恩关上你身后的门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_End_b6c8e231:

    # "You walks on home with Seb and Ole."
    "你和塞布、奥利一起走回家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_End_797de81a:

    # "You take in the surroundings of Lusterfield."
    "你攻占乐斯民菲尔德的周围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_End_0987da05:

    # "It is not Puro. And your clanspeople are not here."
    "这里没有普罗。你的族人也不在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_End_6ba5fa0a:

    # "What happened to Chime remains unanswered."
    "齐门的事至今仍未得到答复。"

translate schinese_rewrite Event_Party01_End_8ee7ce49:

    # "But at least... Lusterfield is starting to feel a bit more like home."
    "但至少... 乐斯民菲尔德开始觉得自己更像家了。"
